<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Joba</book>
  <para style="h">Joba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joba</para>
  <para style="mt">Joba</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlang pakhat, a ming ah Job tah Uz khohmuen ah om. Tekah hlang tah cuemthuek neh a thuem la, Pathen aka rhih tih boethae lamloh aka nong la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anih te capa parhih neh canu pathum a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anih kah boiva he boiva thawng rhih, kalauk thawng thum, vaito rhoi ya nga, laak ya nga om. Imkhut khaw muep ping tih khothoeng koca boeih lakah hlang len la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ca rhoek khaw cet uh tih amah khohnin vaengah amah im kah buhkoknah rhip a saii uh. Te vaengah a ngannu pathum te a tah uh tih a khue uh. A ngannu rhoek khaw amih neh a caak a ok uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Buhkoknah khohnin a poeng van neh Job loh amih te a tah tih a ciim. Job loh, “Ka ca rhoek he tholh uh mai khaming, tedae a thinko ah Pathen uem mai saeh,” a ti. Te dongah amih boeih a tarhing la mincang ah thoo tih hmueihhlutnah a nawn. Te tlam te Job loh hnin takuem a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnin at ah Pathen ca rhoek te cet uh tih BOEIPA taengah pai. Te vaengah Satan khaw amih lakli ah cet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Satan te, “Me lamkah lae na pawk,” a ti nah. Te vaengah Satan loh BOEIPA te doo tih, “Diklai ah ka van thikthuek tih a khuiah ka pongpa coeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te dongah BOEIPA loh Satan te, “Ka sal Job ke na lungbuei ah na khueh a? Anih bangla a cuemthuek neh aka thuem, Pathen aka rhih tih boethae lamloh aka nong hlang he diklai ah om pawh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Satan loh BOEIPA te a doo tih, “Lunglilungla mai la Job loh Pathen a rhih tang nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namah loh anih ham neh a imkhui ham khaw, a taengkah boeih ham khaw vong na buk pah moenih a? A kut dongkah bibi te yoe na then sak tih a boiva loh diklai ah pungtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tedae na kut na hlah lamtah anih hut te boeih ben lah, na mikhmuh ah nang n'uem tang mahpawh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Satan te, “A taengkah boeih ke na kut ah om ne. Tedae amah soah tah na kut hlah boeh,” a ti nah. Te phoeiah Satan te BOEIPA mikhmuh lamloh khoe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnin at vaengah a capa rhoek neh a canu rhoek loh a maya caming im ah buh a caak uh tih misurtui a ok uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te vaengah Job taengla puencawn ha pawk tih, “Vaito te olmueh la om tih a hmatoeng ah laak luem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tedae Sheba tah capit uh tih te rhoek te a mawt coeng. Camoe rhoek te khaw cunghang ha neh a ngawn uh. Kai kamah bueng he nang taengah aka puen la dawk ka loeih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te te a thui li vaengah pakhat ha pawk tih, “Pathen hmai tah vaan lamloh tla tih boiva te a toih coeng. Camoe rhoek te khaw a hlawp coeng. Kai kamah bueng he nang taengah aka puen la dawk ka loeih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te te thui li vaengah pakhat ha pawk tih, “Khalden rhoek hlop thum la yolh uh tih kalauk dongla capit uh. Te rhoek te a khuen phoeiah camoe rhoek te cunghang ha neh a ngawn. Kai kamah bueng he nang taengah aka puen la dawk ka loeih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te te a thui vaengah pakhat a pawk pah tih, “Na capa rhoek neh na canu rhoek loh buh a caak uh tih a maya caming im ah misurtui a ok uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te vaengah rhalvang khosoek lamloh khohli puei tarha cu tih im kil pali te a nen. Te dongah camoe rhoek a cungku thil tih duek uh. Kai kamah bueng he nang taengah aka puen la dawk ka loeih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te vaengah Job thoo tih a hnikul te a phen. A lu te a vok. Diklai la khup tih bakop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te phoeiah, “A nu bungko lamloh ka thoeng vaengah, pumtling la ka thoeng tih pumtling la ka mael ni. BOEIPA a paek tih BOEIPA loh a loh dongah, BOEIPA ming tah yoethen la om pai saeh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A cungkuem dongah he Job tholh pawt tih Pathen taengah khaw a hohap a paek moenih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tue a pha vaengah Pathen ca rhoek loh cet uh BOEIPA taengah pai uh. Te vaengah Satan khaw BOEIPA taengah pai hamla amih lakli ah cet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Satan te, “Me lamkah lae na pawk he,” a ti nah. Te vaengah Satan loh BOEIPA te a doo tih, “Diklai ah ka van thikthuek tih a khuiah aka pongpa lamloh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te dongah BOEIPA loh Satan te, “Ka sal Job ke na lungbuei ah na khueh a? Anih bangla a cuemthuek neh aka thuem, Pathen aka rhih tih boethae lamloh aka nong hlang he diklai ah om pawh. Anih tah a muelhtuetnah dongah cak pueng. Lunglilungla la anih dolh ham ni amah taengah kai nan vueh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Satan loh BOEIPA te a doo tih, “A vin ham a vin coeng tih a hinglu ham te hlang taengla boeih a paek ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tedae na kut hlah laeh lamtah a rhuh neh a saa te ben lah saeh, na mikhmuh ah nang te n'uem rhet mahpawh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah BOEIPA loh Satan te, “Anih te namah kut ah om dae a hinglu te tah ngaithuen,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te dongah Satan te BOEIPA mikhmuh lamloh khoe uh tih Job te buhlut thae neh a kho khopha lamloh a luki duela a ngawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te te khoeih hamla amah loh paikaek a loh tih hmaiphu khui ah ngol.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te vaengah anih te a yuu loh, “Nang loh na muelhtuetnah te na pom bal pueng, Pathen te uem lamtah duek pahoi,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tedae amah te na ang cal la na cal. Pathen taeng lamloh hnothen n'doe tih yoethae he n'doe mahpawt nim?” a ti nah. Te boeih khuiah pataeng Job he a hmuilai nen khaw a tholh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih soah yoethae cungkuem a pai he Job kah a hui pathum loh a yaak. Te vaengah Temani Eliphaz, Shuhi Bildad, Naamathi Zophar te amah hmuen lamloh rhip cet uh tih Job suem ham neh hloep ham aka cet la tun hum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hla lamloh a mik te a huel uh vaengah amah te hmat uh pawh. Te dongah a ol a huel uh tih rhap uh. A hnikul te rhip a phen uh tih laipi te a lu soah vaan la a haeh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih te diklai dongah khothaih hnin rhih neh khoyin hnin rhih a ngol puei uh. Thakkhoeihnah loh mat a tluek te a hmuh dongah a taengah ol cal uh pawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Job a ka te a ang tih a khohnin te a tap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te vaengah Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah kah thang nah khohnin neh, “Tongpa a yom,” a ti hlaem khaw paltham mai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te khohnin te a hmuep la om palueng vetih, Pathen loh a so la toem pawt mako. Te dongah vangnah loh te soah sae boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te te hmaisuep neh dueknah hlipkhup loh suk saeh. A soah khomai yaal saeh lamtah, hlamhop hnin bangla let saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tekah hlaem te a hmuep loh lo saeh lamtah kum khat kah khohnin dongah a kohoe boel saeh, hla taenah dongah khaw kun boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tekah hlaem te pumhong la om saeh lamtah a khuiah omngaih laa cuen boel saeh ne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khohnin thae aka phoei thil tih, a coekcoe la Leviathan aka haeng loh, te te tap saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlaemhmah aisi khaw hmuep saeh lamtah, khosae te lamtawn cakhaw sae boel saeh, mincang khosaeng te hmu boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka bungko thohkhaih te a khaih mai vetih thakthaenah he ka mik lamloh a thuh mai kolla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Balae tih bung khuiah ka duek pawh. Bungko lamloh ka thoeng tih ka pal hae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Balae tih khuklu loh kai n'doe, balae tih rhangsuk loh n'khut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka yalh to palueng koinih la ka ip mong vetih ka duem lah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manghai rhoek neh a imrhong aka thoh diklai olrhoep rhoek taengla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amih taengkah sui mangpa rhoek neh a im ah tangka aka hawn rhoek taengah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rhumpu bangla n'thuh kanoek vetih vangnah aka hmuh noek pawh camoe rhoek bangla ka om pawt mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Teah te halang rhoek loh khoponah a toeng uh tih thadueng aka bawt khaw pahoi duem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thongtla rhoek te rhenten rhalthal uh tih, tueihno ol ya uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tanoe neh kangham khaw amah la om pahoi tih sal khaw a boei taeng lamloh sayalh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Balae tih thakthaekung taengah vangnah, hinglu khahing taengah hingnah a paek?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dueknah hamla aka rhingda long khaw dang hae pawt tih kawn lakah te te a too.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Phuel a hmuh uh vaengah omngaihnah neh a ngaingaih la a kohoe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A longpuei te hlang ham tah a thuh dae a taengah Pathen loh a mak pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka buh hmai ah ka hueinah ha pawk tih ka kawknah he tui bangla pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Birhihnah neh ka birhih akhaw kamah m'vuei tih ka rhih nawn te khaw kamah taengah thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka dingsuek pawt tih ka mong pawh, ka duem pawt vaengah khoponah ha thoeng,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te vaengah Temani hoel Eliphaz loh a doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te vaengah nang te ol neh n'noemcai saeh, na ngak aya? Tedae olthui te kuemsuem ham unim aka noeng eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Muep na toel tih kut kha rhoek khaw na talong coeng te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aka paloe rhoek te na olthui loh a thoh tih khuklu aka khun khaw na caang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tedae namah taengla ha loe tih na ngak coeng, namah te m'ben tih na let coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na hinyahnah, na ueppangnah, na ngaiuepnah, na longpuei kah thincaknah khaw om pawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Poek van laeh, ommongsitoe he paltham nim? Aka thuem rhoek te melam a thup?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmuh vanbangla boethae aka thoe tih aka soem khaw amah long ni thakthaenah a ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathen kah hiil dongah milh uh tih a thintoek khohli dongah khap uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sathueng khaw kawknah neh sathuengca khaw a ol neh om dae sathuengca khaw a no tloong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maeh a mueh lamloh sathueng te milh tih sathuengnu ca rhoek khaw pam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka taengah ol a huen tih a olduem loh kai hna a lat sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlang he khoyin olphong lamkah pomnah khuiah a ih muelh vaengah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />birhihnah loh kai m'mah tih thuennah neh ka rhuh boeih a rhih sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mueihla loh ka maelhmai a pah vaengah ka mul ka saa poenghu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pai vaengah khaw a mueimae ka hmat moenih. A muei tah ka mikhmuh ah om tih bidip ol a yaak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathen lakah hlanghing he tang tih anih aka saii lakah ah hlang caihcil ngai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sal rhoek soah tangnah pawt tih a puencawn te a lolh la a khueh atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laipi neh lai im dongah kho aka sa aisat te bungbo hmai ah a khoengim pop coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mincang lamloh hlaem duela a phop te a yoeyah la a milh khaw mingpha pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amih lamkah a a hlangrhuel a phil pah vaengah a duek uh moenih a? Te dongah cueihnah neh a om moenih a?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khue laeh nang aka doo om nim? U hlangcim taengah na mael ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aka ang te konoinah loh a ngawn tih hloih loh thatlainah a duek sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aka ang loh a yung a hlak ka hmuh vaengah a tolkhoeng buengrhuet ka tap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ca rhoek te khangnah lamloh lakhla tih vongka ah a phop uh vaengah aka huul om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A cangah te bungpong loh a caak pah tih hlinghang lamkah a loh dae a thadueng te tuihal loh a mam pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Laipi lamloh boethae thoeng pawt tih diklai lamloh thakthaenah a poe bal moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tedae hlang he thakthaenah khuiah a sak tih rhaek ca rhoek bangla ding hang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tedae kai tah Pathen te ka toem vetih Pathen taengah ni ka dumlai khaw ka hal eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A len la a saii vaengah khobaerhambae te khenah lek pawh, tae lek pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Diklai hman ah khotlan a paek tih lohma li ah tui a hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlarhoel rhoek te hmuensang ah a khueh tih kopang rhoek te khangnah khuila a hoeptlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aka thaai kah kopoek te a phae tih a kut loh lungming cueihnah saii thai pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aka cueih khaw amah kah rhaithinah neh a tuuk tih aka hlang hnuei kah cilsuep he hma paitok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khothaih ah a hmuep neh hum uh tih khothun ah khoyin bangla a phatuem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khodaeng te amih ka dongkah cunghang lamlong khaw tlungluen kut lamloh a khang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te dongah tattloel ham ngaiuepnah om dae dumlai loh amah ka a buem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathen loh a toel hlanghing he a yoethen tih Tlungthang kah thuituennah sit boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah loh a tloh sak dae a hma te a poi pah tih a kut dongah hoeih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Citcai parhuk lamloh nang n'huul vetih a parhih ah yoethae loh nang soah m'ben mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang te khokha vaengah dueknah lamloh, caemtloek vaengah cunghang kut lamloh n'lat ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Olka dongkah rhuihet lamloh n'thuh vetih rhoelrhanah a pai vaengah na rhih mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rhoelrhanah khui neh khokha rhamling khuiah na luem vetih diklai mulhing te na rhih mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na paipi te khohmuen lungto taengah om vetih kohong mulhing loh nang taengah n'thuung ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na dap kah rhoepnah te na ming vetih na tolkhoeng na soep vaengah na hmaai mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na tiingan muep na ming vetih na cadil cahma te khohmuen baelhing bangla om ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tue vaengkah canghlom a coi bangla na hminkhah vaengah phuel te na paan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He tah amah la n'khe uh tangloeng he ne. He he hnatun lamtah namah loh namah dongah ming,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka konoinah ka thuek, ka thuek vetih ka talnah he cooi dongah ka tloeng rhenten koinih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuitunli kah laivin lakah n'nan ngawn coeng. Te dongah ka ol he lawn coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlungthang thaltang dongah a sue te ka khuiah ka mueihla loh a mam. Pathen kah hihhamnah loh kai taengah rhong a pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohong marhang khaw baelhing soah pang tih, vaito te a kamvuelh soah rhung bal nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungkaeh om kolla ankak a caak tih aiduei dakda dongah a hlihlim om aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amih te ka hinglu loh ben ham a aal tih ka buh khaw kolet la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka huithuinah he ulong m'paek vetih a thoeng eh? Tedae ka ngaiuepnah he Pathen long ni m'paek eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathen he mulmet vetih kai he m'phop, a kut a hlam vetih kai m'mueluem mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te vaengah kai ham hloephloeinah om dae lah sue. Te vaengah bungtloh khuiah ka uem mako. Hlangcim te ka phah pawt bangla n'lungma sak pawt mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngaiuep ham ka thadueng khaw menim? Ka hinglu ka hlawt ham ka hmailong khaw menim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thadueng he lungto thadueng nim? Ka saa he rhohumsen a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai ham he kamah kah bomnah om ngawn pawt tih lungming cueihnah khaw kai lamloh a heh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngaidaeng loh tlungthang hinyahnah a hnoo vaengah pataeng a baerhoep taengkah sitlohnah a dang van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka manuca rhoek khaw soklong bangla la hnukpoh tih sokca soklong bangla kak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amih te vueltling loh a nu sak tih vuelsong a yut pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kho a awlh vaengah a bae neh huu tih amah hmuen lamloh kak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A caehlong longpuei a hoi uh tih hinghong la a caeh dongah milh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tema caehlong kah rhoek loh a paelki uh tih, Sheba lambong amih ham a lamtawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pangtung uh dongah yak uh tih a taengla a pawk uh akhaw a hmai tal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A taengah a hong la na om uh van coeng dongah rhihkoi na hmuh vaengah na rhih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Kai taengah m'pae uh lamtah na thadueng lamloh kai hamla kapbaih pae uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rhal kut lamloh kai n'loeih sak lamtah hlanghaeng kut lamloh kai n'lat uh,” ka ti noek a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kai n'thuinuet lamtah ka ngam bitni. Metla ka palang khaw kai he m'ming sakuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Balae tih hlang dueng ol rhap rhap a cal? Nangmih lamloh a tluung ham khaw balae a tluung?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Olthui te tluung hamla na moeh uh nama? Ol khaw khohli bangla talsae mai pawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cadah ham aisat hmulung na naan vetih na hui hamla na tael pah nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tedae mulmet uh laeh, kai taengla mael uh. Nangmih maelhmai ah ka laithae nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mael uh laeh, dumlai la om uh boeh, mael uh laeh, koep mael uh laeh. Ka duengnah he a khuiah om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lai dongah dumlai om nim? Ka dang loh talnah yakming pawt maco.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Diklai hman ah hlanghing hamla caempuei a om moenih a? A khohnin te kutloh kah khohnin banghui ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sal bangla hlipkhup a hloep tih kutloh bangla a bisai a lamtawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka taengah a poeyoek la a hla ka pang van tih thakthaenah hlaem he kai hamla a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka yalh tih, “Me vaengah nim ka thoh ve?” ka ti. Khoyin loh puh tih hlaemhmah duela yutnah khaw ka cung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka saa loh a rhit a bai, ka vin laipi tiknong khaw uet tih a tuei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khohnin loh tampai lakah bawn tih lungli lungla la ngaiuepnah bawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hingnah mueihla he poek lah. Hnothen hmuh ham khaw ka mik loh mael voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kai aka so mik loh kai m'mae voel mahpawh. Na mik te kai soah om dae kai ka om voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cingmai loh haai tih cing, saelkhui la aka suntla rhoek tah ha mael tangloeng pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A im la koep mael pawt vetih a hmuen loh anih hmat voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te dongah kai khaw ka ka tuem mahpawh. Ka mueihla khobing doela ka thui vetih. Ka hinglu khahing doela ka lolmang pueng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai he tuipuei tuihnam tih nim kai soah thongim na khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka soengca kai n'hloep bitni, ka thingkong loh ka kohuetnah te a phueih bitni ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mueimang neh kai nan rhihyawp sak tih olphong neh kai nan let sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hinglu loh ka rhuhrhong lakah khaknah neh dueknah ni a. coelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kohnue coeng, kumhal duela ka hing mahpawh, kai he n'toeng laeh, ka khohnin khaw a honghi ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mebang hlanghing lae amah na pantai sak tih a taengah na lungbuei na khueh te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih te mincang ah na cawh tih mikhaptok ah ni anih te na loepdak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Balae tih kai lamloh na mangthong pawt eh? Ka timtui ka dolh hil kai nan rhael moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hlang aka kueinah nang taengah ka tholh tih balae ka saii? Balae tih kai he na kutnoek la nan khueh. Te dongah kai ham tah hnorhih la ka om coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te dongah ka boekoek he na phueih tih kai kathaesainah he nan khoe mai pawt lae? Laipi khuila ka yalh pawn ni. Kai na toem cakhaw ka om voel moenih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shuhi Bildad loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“He he me hil nim na thui ve? Na ka kah ol tah khohli bangla khuet coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathen loh tiktamnah he a khun sak tih Tlungthang loh duengnah te a khun sak mai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ca rhoek te anih taengah a tholh vaengah amih te amamih kah boekoek kut dongla a tueih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namah loh Pathen te na toem tih Tlungthang te na hloep mak atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na cil tih na thuem koinih nang yueng la haenghang vetih na duengnah rhamtlim te n'thuung pataeng pawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tongnah te a yiit om cakhaw na hmailong te muep rhoeng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lamhma kah cadil taengah dawt laeh lamtah a napa rhoek khenah te soepsoei laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mamih loh n'hlaem paek kah long khaw m'ming uh moenih, mamih kah khohnin diklai dongkah mueihlip banghui ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amih te na thuinuet pawt tih a, nang taengah a thui vetih amih kah lungbuei lamloh olthui te a khueh eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nongtui pawt ah talik thawn tih tui om mueh ah capu rhoeng a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te te a duei pueng ah a hlaek pawt akhaw sulrham boeih hmai ah rhae coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathen aka hnilh boeih kah caehlong neh lailak kah ngaiuepnah tah bing tangloeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A uepnah neh a pangtungnah bumba im te khaw bawtboeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A im dongah hangdang dae pai thai pawh. Te te a kuel dae thoo pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anih te khosae li ah thingsup tih a dum ah a dawn sai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A yung loh lungkuk dongah a ven tih lungto im te a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te te a hmuen lamloh a phuk van vaengah, “Nang kam hmu moenih,” anih te a namnah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />He he a longpuei kah omthennah coeng koinih laipi tloe lamloh a poe uh khaming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathen loh cuemthuek hnawt ngawn pawt tih thaehuet kut te a moem moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ka dongah nueihbu neh na hmui dongah tamlung bae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lunguet rhoek loh yahpohnah a bai uh vetih halang kah dap tah om mahpawh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh koep a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tueng te ka ming tangloeng dae hlanghing he Pathen taengah metlam a tang thai eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah te oelh ham ngaih cakhaw, anih te thawngkhat ah pakhat long pataeng a doo thai moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thinko cueih tih a thadueng khaw len rhapsat. A thuung dongah anih taengah unim aka mangkhak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlang khaw haimo coeng tih a thintoek ah amih a maelh te khaw ming uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Diklai he a hmuen lamloh tlai tih a tung khaw tuen coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khomik te a uen tih thoeng pawh, aisi khaw catui tloep a hnah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaan ke amah bueng loh a cueh tih tuitunli kah hmuensang dongah a cawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ning buhol neh airhitbom khaw, tuithim tlungkawt khaw a saii neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khenah tloel duela hno len a saii tih tae lek pawt hil ah khobaerhambae coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai taeng long a pah mai akhaw ka hmu pawt tih a tinghil akhaw anih te ka yakming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Paco cakhaw ulong anih a mael sak? Ulong long anih te, “Balae na saii,” a ti nah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathen tah a thintoek mael pawt tih Rahab aka bom rhoek khaw a hmui, a hmui ah ngam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te dongah anih aisat te kai loh ka doo thai vetih a taengah ka ol ka coelh thai aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tang cakhaw kai lai aka tloek taengah ka doo thai pawt tih rhennah ni ka bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka khue tih kai n'doo cakhaw ka ol a hnatun tila ka tangnah moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlithae neh kai kai m'phop tih lunglilungla la ka tloh ping.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mueihla he mael hamla kai m'pae pawt dae olkhaa ni kai n'kum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thadueng dongah khaw len rhapsat tih laitloeknah dongah khaw unim kai aka tuentah he?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ka neh ka tang akhaw ka boe hae ni, ka cuemthuek cakhaw ka kawn hae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka cuemthuek dae ka hinglu khaw ka ming pawt tih ka hingnah khaw ka kohnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te dongah pakhat la, “Cuemthuek neh halang khaw amah loh a khah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rhuihet loh a duek sak buengrhuet kae vaengah ommongsitoe kah noemcainah te a tamdaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Diklai he halang kut ah pae tih a laitloek kah maelhmai te a khuk. Te pawt koinih amah te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka khohnin khaw aka yong lakah bawn tih a yong dongah a then khaw hmuh uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sangpho canghlong bangla tinghil tih, atha bangla caak dongah cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Kai he ka kohuetnah ka hnilh pawn eh, ka maelhmai ka hlam saeh lamtah ngaidip saeh,’ ka ti akhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka nganboh he boeih ka rhih tih kai nan hmil mahpawh tila ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kai ka boe coeng dae balae tih a honghi nen he ka kohnue eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vuelsong tui dongah ka hluk vetih ka kut lunghuem neh ka cil cakhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />vaam khuila kai nan nuem hae vetih ka himbai neh kamah khaw n'tuei uh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hlang he kamah bangla a om pawt dongah anih te ka doo koinih laitloeknah la rhenten m'pawk uh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mamih laklo ah oltloek tih mamih rhoi soah a kut aka tloeng om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A cungkui te kai taeng lamloh a khoe mai vetih a mueirhih loh kai n'let sak pawt mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka thui neh anih ka rhih pawt dae kai he kamah taengah te tlam te ka om moenih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hingnah soah ka hinglu loh a ko-oek coeng. Ka kohuetnah he kamah taengah ka sah tih ka hinglu a khahing hil ka thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathen taengah, “Kai m'boe sak boeh, balae tih kai nan ho, kai m'ming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kut thaphu na hnawt vaengah halang kah cilsuep dongah na sae tih na hnaemtaek te nang ham then a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlanghing he na sawt tih na hmuh bangla nang taengah pumsa mik om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khohnin he hlanghing khohnin bangla, na kum khaw hlang khohnin bangla om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah kai kathaesainah te na tlap tih ka tholhnah hnukah nan toem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka boe pawt tih na kut lamloh a huul thai pawt te na mingnah dongah om pataeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kut loh kai n'noih pai tih thikat la kai n'saii akhaw kai nan dolh pawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amlai bangla kai nan saii tih laipi la kai nan mael sak te poek mai lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suktui bangla kai nan sui tih sukkhal bangla kai nan khal sak moenih a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai he ka vin ka saa neh nan dah tih ka rhuh neh tharhui neh nan cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hingnah neh sitlohnah te kai taengah nan khueh tih ka mueihla loh na ngoldoelh a ngaithuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tedae na thinko ah na khoem he na khuiah tila ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tholh sitoe cakhaw kai nan ngaithuen dongah kai kathaesainah lamloh kai nan hmil moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ya-oe kai he ka boe akhaw, ka tang akhaw ka lu ka dangrhoek moenih. Yah ka hah tih ka phacip phabaem loh n'yan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sathuengca bangla a phul atah kai nan mae tih kai taengah khobaerhambae la na mael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na laipai neh kai hmai ah nan tlaih tih kai taengah na konoinah na hong. Thovaelnah neh caempuei la kai taengah na pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Balae tih bung khui lamloh loh kai nan poh. Ka pal palueng vetih mik loh kai m'hmu pawt mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A om khaw a om pawt bangla bungko lamloh phuel la n'khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka khohnin he bawn tih a muei la a muei moenih a? Kai lamkah he na dueh na dueh vetih ka ngaidip laem mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka caeh hlan vaengah hmaisuep khohmuen neh dueknah hlipkhup la ka mael pawt mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khoyinnah kho tah dueknah hlipkhup a hmuep bangla om tih cikngae pawh. Te dongah a hmuep la sae,’ ka ti ni,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naamathi Zophar loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ol cungkuem te a doo moenih a? Hlang he a hmuilai ngawn tah tang dae ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na olsai te hlang loh ngam vetih na tamdaeng vaengah a hmaithae mahpawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te vaengah, “Ka rhingtuknah he cil tih na mikhmuh ah a caih la ka om,” na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang taengah aka thui la Pathen loh unim dawk a paek tih a hmuilai ong koinih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungming cueihnah he rhaepnit a lo dongah cueihnah olhuep te nang taengah a thui pawn ko. Namah kathaesainah lamloh Pathen loh nang n'hnilh te ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathen kah khenah na hmuh tih Tlungthang kah a khuetnah hil na hmuh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaan la a sang te metlam na saii eh? Saelkhui lakah a dung te metlam na ming eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A himbaidok loh diklai lakah a puet tih tuitunli lakah dangka ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hil tih a tlaeng tih a tingtun sak phoeiah tah ulong anih a mael sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah loh a poeyoek hlang rhoek khaw a ming ngawn dae boethae a hmuh vaengah yakming pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tedae tuihong hlang loh hloih koinih kohong marhang neh laak te hlang la a sak khaming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lungbuei na cikngae tih a taengla na kut na phuel koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kut dongkah boethae te na lakhla tak tih na dap ah dumlai na khueh pawt atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lolhmaih kolla na maelhmai na ludoeng van bitni. Na om vaengah khaw tluektluek na long vetih na rhih om mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang ham tah thakthaenah te na hnilh vetih tui aka long voelh bangla na poek bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khosak khaw khothun lakah sae vetih, a hmuep khaw mincang bangla om ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaiuepnah a om dongah na pangtung vetih ngaikhuek la na too phoeiah na yalh bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na kol vaengah na lakueng neh na maelhmai muep thae voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tedae halang kah mik tah kha vetih thuhaelnah khaw amih lamloh bing ni, a ngaiuepnah khaw hinglu polpainah la om ni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pilnam khaw nangmih taengkah cueihnah a duek ham tueng pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tedae kai khaw nangmih bangla thinko ka khueh. Nangmih lamloh ka yalh sut moenih. Te dongah u taengah nim he bang a om pawt eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathen taengah ka pang khaw a hui taengah nueihbu la ka om. A cuemthuek neh a dueng khaw nueihbu la a doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mongkawt kah kopoek ah yoethaenah he nueihbu la om tih a kho aka paloe ham a tawn pah bangla om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rhoelrhak kah dap te dingsuek lah tih, Pathen kah a tlai thil khaw a ciip la om. Te long te a kut dongah Pathen a khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tedae rhamsa rhoek te dawt laeh lamtah nang n'thuinuet bitni. Vaan kah vaa long khaw nang taengla ha puen bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Diklai taengah khaw lolmang lamtah nang n'thuinuet vetih tuitunli kah nga loh nang hamla han tae bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He he BOEIPA kut loh a saii tila te boeih khuikah aka ming pawt te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kut dongah mulhing boeih kah hinglu neh hlang pumsa boeih kah mueihla khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lai caak a ten bangla olthui te hna loh a nuemnai moenih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Patong taengah cueihnah om tih khohnin aka sen te a lungcuei om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A taengah cueihnah om tih a taengah thayung thamal, cilsuep neh lungcuei khaw om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A koengloeng phoeiah tah thoh uh thai pawt tih hlang te a tlaeng phoeiah tah a ong pa uh thai moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui te a kueng tih kak coeng ke. Te te a hlah bal tih diklai a khuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarhi neh lungming cueihnah khaw amah hut, aka taengphael neh aka palang khaw amah hut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ol aka uen te khotling la a khuen tih laitloek rhoek te a yan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manghai rhoek kah thuituennah a ah pah tih amih kah cinghen te hailaem a khih pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khosoih rhoek te khotling la a khuen tih khangmai rhoek khaw a paimaelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tangnah kah a ka khaw a baeh tih patong rhoek a omih khaw a loh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlangcong rhoek soah nueihbu a hawk tih sokca cihin khaw hlong coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmaisuep lamkah a dung khaw phoe coeng tih dueknah hlipkhup te vangnah khuila a khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Namtom te a puel sak phoeiah a milh sak. Namtom te a yaal tih a mawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Diklai pilnam boeilu kah lungbuei a doek pah tih amih te hinghong ah longpuei pawt la kho a hmang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vangnah om pawt vaengah hmaisuep a phatuem uh tih yurhui bangla amih te kho a hmang sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A cungkuem he ka mik loh a hmuh coeng. Te te Ka hna yaak tih a yakming coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmih kah mingnah bangla kai khaw ka ming tih nangmih kai he nangmih lakah ka toem moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tedae kai tah Tlungthang taengah ka thui tih Pathen taengah ka ngaih bangla ka tluung lah sue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tedae nangmih ah laithae kap tih nangmih boeih te mueirhol siboei ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />U long nim n'ngam sak lah sue? Na ngam uh lah vetih nangmih ham cueihnah la om mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai kah toelthamnah hnatun dae lamtah ka hmuilai dongkah tuituknah he hnatung uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathen yueng la dumlai na thui uh vetih amah yueng la vuelvaeknah na thui uh aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A maelhmai na then sak uh vetih Pathen yueng la na ho uh aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmih te n'khe vetih hlanghing taengkah omsaa bangla a taengah na omsaa uh koinih then aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yinhnuk ah maelhmai na dan uh koinih a tluung ham khaw nangmih te ni n'tluung eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A boeimang loh nangmih te n'let sak tih amah kah birhihnah loh nangmih soah tla het mahpawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmih poekkoepnah he hmaiphu dongkah banghui, nangmih kah amkhawn khaw amlai amkhawn banghui ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai taengah hilphah uh lamtah ka cal mai akhaw kamah taengah mebang khaw thoeng mai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Balae tih ka saa te ka no dongla ka khueh vetih ka hinglu he ka kut neh ka pom eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kai n'rhaem mai cakhaw amah taengah ka ngaiuep mahpawt nim? Ka longpuei he a mikhmuh ah ka thui pueng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He khaw kai hamla khangnah la om pai. Lailak tah a mikhmuh la kun mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmih hna dongkah ka olthui neh ka olhoe he hnatun khaw hnatun mai dae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tang ni tila ka ming dongah laitloeknah ka tawn coeng he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai aka ho te unim? Ka ngam mai laeh vetih ka pal mai mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai taengah panit bueng saii boeh, na mikhmuh lamloh ka ying pawt ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kut te kai dong lamloh lakhla sak lamtah na mueirhih neh kai n'let sak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te phoeiah n'khue lamtah ka doo bitni. Ka thui saeh lamtah kai he n'thuung saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka taengkah thaesainah neh tholhnah he meyet nim? Ka boekoeknah neh ka boirhaem lai kai n'tueng lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Balae tih na maelhmai na thuh, kai he na taengkah thunkha bangla nan moeh mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hawnlae a yawn nim na na sairhing vetih divawt rhae te na hloem eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kai taengah khahing te nan daek tih ka camoe thaesainah te kai nan pang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka kho he hloong dongah nan buen tih ka caehlong boeih na ngaithuen. Ka kho dongkah khotang ham kha na vuel coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Te khaw keet bangla hmawn tih himbai bangla bungbo loh a caak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huta kah a sak hlang he a khohnin toi tih khoponah khaw hah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rhaipai bangla phuelh tih a oh uh. Khokhawn bangla yong tih pai voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te soah ngawn tah na mik tueng tih kai he na taengkah laitloeknah dongla na khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rhalawt lamloh a cuem la aka khueh te unim? Pakhat pataeng om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A khohnin neh a hla taenah khaw namah taengah hangdang. A oltlueh te a oltlueh bangla na saii tih poe thai pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih lamloh vawl mangthong lamtah amah hnin at kutloh bangla a ngaingaih hil toeng saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thing ham tah a vung akhaw ngaiuepnah om pueng. Te dongah koep mikhing vetih a dawn khaw ngoeng mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Diklai khuiah a yung patong mai tih laipi khuiah a ngo duek cakhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tui bo ah duei vetih thinghloe bangla a pae cawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tedae hlang tah duek tih rhaa uh coeng. Hlang he a pal phoeiah tah melam a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuitunli lamkah tui khaw khawk dae tuiva loh a khah vaengah tah kak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlang khaw yalh tih thoo voel pawh. Vaan a om pawt due khaw haenghang pawh. Amih te ih kung lamloh haenghang uh mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unim saelkhui ah a paek lah ve? Kai he nan khoem lah vetih na thintoek a mael duela kai nan thuh lah mako. Kai hamla oltlueh na khueh vetih kai nan poek mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlang he duek koinih hing venim? Kamah kah caempuei hnin boeih he ka thovaelnah a pawk hil ka lamtawn bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan khue vaengah kai loh nang te ka doo bitni. Na kut dongkah bibi dongah na moo bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka khokan he na tae pawn vetih ka tholhnah khaw na dawn mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka boekoek hnocun khuiah catui a hnah thil tih kai kathaesainah na dah thil bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tedae Tlang khaw cungku tih moelh. Lungpang pataeng a hmuen lamloh thoeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lungto khaw tui loh a hoh tih a kongnawt loh diklai laipi a yo. Te dongah hlanghing kah ngaiuepnah na pal sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih te a yoeyah la na khulae tih a hmai a tal la a van daengah anih te na tueih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ca rhoek a thangpom uh dae a ming moenih. Muei uh cakhaw amih a yakming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tedae a pumsa tah a taengah tih thak a khoeih tih a hinglu khaw amah hamla nguekcoi,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Temani Eliphaz loh a doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te vaengah, “Aka cueih loh khohli mingnah neh a doo vetih a bung ah kanghawn a hah sak aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A taengah hmaiben pawt tih a hoeikhang pawh olthui te ol neh a tluung aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang aisat, hinyahnah na muei sak tih Pathen mikhmuh kah thuepnah khaw na bim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ka loh namah kathaesainah a cang tih thaai ol na coelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ka loh nang m'boe sak tih kai long moenih. Na hmuilai long ni namah te n'doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlang lamhma la n'sak tih som a om hlan lamloh n'yom coeng a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathen kah baecenol te na yaak tih namah hamla cueihnah na buem a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ming uh pawt te metlam na ming tih kaimih taengah amah a om pawt khaw na yakming?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sampok khaw, mamih taengkah patong khaw na pa lakah a khohnin khuet coeng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathen loh hloephloeinah neh na taengah dikdik a cal ol nang hamla vawt a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Balae tih na lungbuei na a khuen? Balae tih na mik loh a mikmuelh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thintoek te Pathen taengla na hooi tih na ka lamloh ol na tha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huta kah a sak te mebang hlanghing nim aka cim tih aka tang te?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hlangcim khuikah a hlangcim koek pataeng tangnah pawt tih vaan pataeng amah mikhmuh ah a cil moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tui bangla dumlai aka mam hlang, a tueilaeh neh a rhonging aisat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang taengah kan thui eh kai ol he hnatun dae. Ka hmuh te kan tae eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te te hlangcueih rhoek loh a thui uh tih a napa rhoek taeng lamloh a phah uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amih te amamih bueng ham khohmuen a paek vaengah amih lakli ah kholong a nuen sak moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Halang tah hnin takuem amah kilkul tih hlanghaeng ham a kum tarhing la khoem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngaimongnah khuiah pataeng anih aka rhoelrhak ham a hna ah birhihnah ol a pawk pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmaisuep lamloh mael ham tangnah pawt tih rhaltawt long khaw amah cunghang te dongah tawt uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Buh hamla amah poeng tih a kut ah hmaisuep khohnin bangla a tawn te metlam a ming eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih te rhal loh a let sak tih caem dongah a coekcoe la aka om manghai bangla khobing loh anih te a khulae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathen taengah a kut a thueng tih Tlungthang taengah phuel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A rhawn kah uen a thah la a taengah a photling a yong puei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A maelhmai te a tha neh a khuk tih a uen duela bungkawt laep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tedae khopuei khosa khaw a im ding te lungkuk la a phaek uh tih a khuiah khosa uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Boei pawt vetih a thadueng khaw pai mahpawh. Amih kah khohrhang loh diklai ah pungtai mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmaisuep lamloh nong thai mahpawh. A dawn te hmairhong loh a hae vetih a ka dongkah yilh loh a khoe ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A poeyoek dongah tangnah boel saeh lamtah a poeyoek dongah khohmang boel saeh. A hnothung khaw a poeyoek lamni a om eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A khohnin loh cup pawt vetih a rhophoe khaw hing mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Misur a thaihkang bangla hul vetih olive rhaipai bangla rhul ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lailak kah hlangboel tah pumhong la om vetih kapbaih kah dap tah hmai loh a hlawp ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />thakthaenah la vawn tih boethae a sak. A bungko khaw hlangthai palat cuen,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Te bang ol te muep ka yaak coeng. Nangmih boeih kah a hloep khaw thakthaenah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khohli ol te a bawtnah om a? Balae tih na doo hamla nang n'huek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai khaw nang bangla ka thui thai ta. Na hinglu te ka hinglu yueng la om koinih olthui neh nangmih te kan sun vetih ka lu lamloh nangmih taengah ka hinghuen van ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ka neh nangmih te kan duel lah vetih ka hmuilai kah thaphohnah loh n'hoeptlang mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thui akhaw ka thakkhoeihnah a rhoei moenih. Ka paa koinih kai lamloh metlam a caeh eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hlangboel boeih khaw na pong uh tih ka ngak ngawn coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kai nan tonga sak khaw laipai la om coeng. Ka laithae khaw ka taengah pai sak tih ka mikhmuh ah n'doo coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thintoek loh a baeh tih kai soah a konaeh. Kai taengah a no te a tah coeng. Ka rhal loh kai soah a mik a huel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ka neh kai n'ang thil uh. Kokhahnah neh ka kam han taam uh tih kai taengah huek ha cu uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathen loh kai he hlang thae taengla n'det tih halang kut dongla kai m'muek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thayoeituipan la ka om vaengah kai m'phae. Ka rhawn ah n'khak tih kai he n'taekyak. Te dongah kai he amah ham kutnoek la m'pai sak coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka taengah a lithen rhoek loh m'vael uh tih ka kuel a khoh. Lungma a ti kolla diklai dongah ka hmuet phawt coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A puut hman ah a puut loh kai m'va. Hlangrhalh bangla kai taengah cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka vin soah tlamhni ka hui tih ka ki khaw laipi neh ka poelyoe coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka maelhmai he rhahnah neh nok la nok uh tih ka mikkhu khaw nut coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te cakhaw boethae ka kut ah kuthlahnah om pawt tih ka thangthuinah khaw cil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Diklai nang loh ka thii he vuei boeh. Ka pang ol he khaw hmuen om boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaan ah pataeng kai kah laipai om tih ka hlangcal khaw hmuensang ah om coeng ke.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hui khaw Pathen taengah kai kah hmuiyoi la om tih ka mik khaw pha coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlang capa tah hlang ham neh a hui ham Pathen taengah a thui ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kum a tarhing ah ha pawk vetih ka mael voel mueh caehlong ah ka cet pawn ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mueihla he pat tih ka khohnin loh khum coeng, kai hamla coeng tih phuel om coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka taengah a omsasaipat pai moenih a? Te dongah amih koek ham khaw ka mik ah rhaeh pai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kai kah rhikhang he namah hamla khueh laeh. Anih te ulong ka kut dongla a khoom eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amih kah lungbuei te lungmingnah lamloh na khoem pah coeng. Te dongah na pomsang sak mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khoyo la a hui a phoe vaengah a ca rhoek mik tah hma coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai he pilnam kah a thuidoek la n'khueh tih maelhmai dongkah timthoeihnah la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mik he konoinah neh hmang coeng tih ka pumrho he khokhawn bangla boeih om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te dongah aka thuem khaw a pong sak tih lailak taengah ommongsitoe a haenghang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tedae aka dueng loh amah longpuei te a tuuk vetih a kut cim khaw a thaa sai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amih te boeih na mael sak uh coeng. Na pawk uh to cakhaw nangmih ah hlangcueih ka hmu mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka khohnin loh thok coeng. Ka thinko kah kohnek la ka poeknah mawth coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khoyin te khothaih la a khueh tih, a hmuep tom te vangnah neh a yoei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saelkhui te ka im bangla ka lamtawn tih, hmaisuep ah ka rhaenghmuen ka saelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaam taengah, “A pa nang,” ka ti nah tih a rhit taengah, “A nu neh ka ngannu,” ka ti nah coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te dongah menim ka ngaiuepnah tih ka ngaiuepnah he unim aka mae?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saelkhui thohka te suntla vetih laipi khuila rhenten n'ael aya?,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shuhi Bildad loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Olthui kah taikhaihnah te me hil nim na khueh ve. Yakming lamtah a hnukah thui sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Balae tih rhamsa bangla nan poek, na mikhmuh ah ka angvawk a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thintoek ah amah hinglu pataeng a baeh ta. Diklai loh a hnoo tih lungpang te a hmuen lamloh a thoeih akhaw nang hut a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Halang rhoek kah vangnah ngawn tah thi tih a hmai te hmaihli bang lam pataeng aa pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vangnah khaw a dap khuiah hmuep tih a hmaithoi khaw amah taengah a thih pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thahuem kah khokan pataeng caek tih a cilsuep loh amah a voeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kho loh lawk khuila a tueih tih sahamlong khuila a pongpa sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A khodil te pael loh a tuuk tih amah te kokthah dongah man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A rhuihet te diklai dongah a tung tih, a sutaeh te a hawn ah a khueh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih te mueirhih loh a kaepvai ah a let sak tih a kho ah taekyak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A boethae ah bungpong la om tih a cungdonah hamla rhainah khaw a sikim pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dueknah caming loh a vin saa a caak pah tih a rhuhrhong a hnom pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pangtungnah a dap lamloh a poh tih mueirhih manghai taengla a luei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amah kah pawt long khaw anih kah dap ah kho a sak tih, a tolkhoeng te yam a phul thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A yung khui ah koh tih a so duela a pae khaw ngat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anih poekkoepnah te diklai lamloh paltham tih a ming te rhamvoel hmai ah om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih te vangnah lamloh a hmuep la a thaek uh tih anih te lunglai lamloh a poeng sakuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A taengah a ca tal tih a pilnam taengah a cadil om pawh. A lampahnah ah khaw rhaengnaeng om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah tue vaengah pong tih a hnuk a hmai la hlithae loh a tuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />He tah boethae kah dungtlungim tih Pathen aka ming pawt kah a hmuen khaw he tlam ni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Me hil nim ka hinglu na pae sak vetih ol neh kai nan phop uh ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Voei rha ka hmai na thae sak uh coeng, kai nan toeh te na yak pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka taengah ka tholh a rhaeh pueng dongah ka palang tueng pataeng ngawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai soah na pantai mai tih kai kokhahnah bangla kai taengah na tluung tueng pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathen loh kai n'khun sak tih amah kah tluum te ka kaepvai ah a vael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuthlahnah te ka doek tih bomah ka bih cakhaw n'doo pawt dongah tiktamnah om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka caehlong he a biing tih ka muk tloel. Ka hawn ah a hmuep a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai kah thangpomnah te kai dong lamloh a pit tih ka lu dongkah rhuisam khaw a dul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai kaepvai lamloh m'palet tih ka pongpa vaengah ka ngaiuepnah he thing bangla a puen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thintoek he kai taengah a sai vaengah kai he amah taengah a rhal bangla m'moeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anih kah caem te rhenten ha pawk uh tih a longpuei te kai m'picai thil uh. Te phoeiah ka dap ah pin rhaeh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka manuca rhoek kai taeng lamloh lakhla coeng tih ka ming rhoek khaw kai lamloh kholong uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka yoei uh rhoek loh n'toeng uh tih ka ming uh rhoek loh kai n'hnilh uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka im pah neh ka salnu rhoek loh kholong bangla kai m'poek uh. Amih mikhmuh ah kholong hlang la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka sal te ka khue dae oei pawh. Anih te ka ka neh ka hloep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mueihla he ka yuu taengah a kholong pah tih ka bungko kah ka ca rhoek taengah khaw rhennah ka bih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Casenca rhoek long pataeng kai he n'hnaep uh tih, ka thoh vaengah kai he n'thui uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka baecenol dongkah hlang boeih loh kai n'tuei uh tih ka lungnah he kamah taengah poehlip uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka vin neh ka saa hil khaw ka rhuh dongla kap tih ka no dongkah nohli neh ka loeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka hui rhoek nangmih loh kai n'rhen uh, kai n'rhen uh. Pathen kut loh kai he m'ben coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Balae tih Pathen bangla kai nan hloem uh. Kai saa lamkah khaw na hah uh hae mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kai ol a daek uh te unim a paek bal. Cabu dongkah bangla a unim a paek vetih a taem uh ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thi cacung neh kawnlawk te lungpang dongah a yoeyah la a dae uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kai tah kai aka tlan te hing tih hmailong kah laipi dongah thoo ni tila ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka vin hnukah he hluep uh cakhaw, ka saa dongah Pathen ka hmuh bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kai kamah long khaw ka hmuh vetih ka mik long khaw a hmuh pueng ni. Te dongah ka rhang kah ka kuel loh rhalawt te a hue moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka khuikah ol hnun a hmuh parhi te, “Anih te metlam n'hloem eh?” na ti uh akhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nangmih te cunghang hmai ah bakuep uh laeh. Amah dumlai tah dumlai bangla na ming uh hamla cunghang lamlothaesainah kosi om coeng,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Naamathi Zophar loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Te dongah ka pomnah kai n'thuung tih kamah khuiah ka tawn uh coeng dongah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thuituennah he mingthae la ka yaak dongah ka yakmingnah dongah mueihla loh kai n'doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suen lamloh diklai dongah hlang a khueh parhi te na ming a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Halang kah omngaih laa tah yoei tih lailak kah kohoenah khaw mikhaptok hil mai ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thinlennah te vaan duela cet tih a lu loh khomai duela puet cakhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a aek bangla a yoeyah la milh vetih anih aka hmu rhoek loh, “Anih ta?” a ti uh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mang bangla a ding phoeiah tah anih te hmu uh pawh. Khoyin kah olphong bangla khum hmata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mik loh a hmuh khaw rhaep mahpawh. Anih te amah hmuen ah mae voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ca rhoek loh tattloel rhoek te a moeithen uh tih a kut loh a thahuem te a mael uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A rhuh tah a cacawn rhoek bangla hah uh dae a cacawn rhoek khaw amah neh laipi dongah ni a. yalh eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ka dongah tui mai cakhaw boethae te a lai hmui ah a thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te te a hnaih tih a toeng pawt dongah a ka khui la a ma-uem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A bung khuikah a buh te a khui ah minta sue la poeh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuehtawn a dolh vaengah a bung khui lamloh lok vetih anih te Pathen loh a talh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minta sue loh a khut vetih rhulthae lai loh amah a ngawn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Soklong, tuiva neh khorha kah khoitui neh suknaeng te hmuh mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thatloh phu te a thuung akhaw a hnothung kah thadueng bangla a dolh pawt dongah yoka pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tattloel te a neet phoeiah amah loh a sak mueh im te a hnoo sak tih a rawth pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bungko lamkah thayoeituipan te ming pawt tih a nai nen khaw loeih pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A caak ham caknoi om pawh. Te dongah a thennah poem hae mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A khuehtawn neh a hah vaengah anih te a daengdaeh vetih thakthaekung kah kut boeih te anih soah thoeng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih bung hah sak ham a taengah amah kah thintoek thinsa a tueih pah vetih a buhcak te anih soah a tlan sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thicung lungpok haica lamloh yong dae anih te rhohum lii loh a kah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A yueh vaengah a pumpu lamloh a pawlh pah. Te vaengah a hmuet khui lamkah mueirhih te amah soah rhaek la a caeh pah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmaisuep cungkuem te khoem hamla a tung. A hmuh mueh hmai loh anih te a hlawp vetih a dap kah rhaengnaeng khaw a talh pah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anih kathaesainah te vaan loh a hliphen uh vetih diklai loh amah taengah a tai pah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thintoeknah hnin ah tah a im kah cangpai khaw a poelyoe pah vetih a hawk pah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Halang hlang loh tebang khoyo te Pathen taeng lamkah a dang tih Pathen loh a ol rho la a khueh pah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Job loh a doo tih tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ol hnatun, hnatun lamtah te te nangmih kah hloephloeinah om saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thui vaengah kai ol he ueh mai lamtah ka thui hnukah nan tamdaeng akhaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai khaw ka kohuetnah he hlang hut a? Balae tih ka mueihla loh a ngen pawt mai eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai taengla a mael vaengah hal tih a kut neh a ka te a puei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka poek bal vaengah ka let tih ka pumsa he tuennah loh a tuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Halang rhoek tah haimo la a hing uh akhaw balae tih tatthai la a len uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A mikhmuh kah a tiingan rhoek neh a mikhmuh kah a cadil cahma khaw amih taengah a cikngae sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amih im khaw birhihnah lamloh ngaimongnah la om tih Pathen kah conghol loh amih soah cuk thil pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A vaito a pil vaengah a vaito a pom khaw tuei pawt tih thangyah tlaih pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A casenca rhoek te boiva bangla a hlah uh tih a camoe rhoek loh soipet uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamrhing neh rhotoeng te a phueih uh tih phavi ol neh a kohoe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amamih vaengkah tue then khuiah muei uh tih hmawn uh. Mikhaptok ah saelkhui la ael uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tedae Pathen taengah, “Kaimih taeng lamloh nong laeh. Na longpuei ming ham ka ngaih uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anih taengah thothueng ham khaw unim tlungthang? A taengah n'cuuk uh ham khaw balae a hoeikhang eh?” a ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amih kah thennah khaw amamih kut ah om pawt lah ko ke. Halang rhoek kah cilsuep te kai lamloh lakhla saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Halang rhoek kah hmaithoi tah metlam khaw thi tih amamih kah rhainah amamih soah a thoeng pah. A thintoek neh a rhilong a suem pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khohli hmai ah cangkong bangla om uh tih cangkik bangla cangpalam loh a khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathen loh a ca rhoek ham a khoem coeng. A boethae te amah taengah thuung saeh lamtah ming saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sitlohthamlam te a mik, a mik ah tueng saeh lamtah tlungthang kah kosi te mam sak saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hnukah a imkhui ham a kongaih te balae? A hla kah a tarhing khaw bawt coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathen te mingnah a tukkil a? Amah he pomsang tih lai a tloek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A cungkuem dongah bidipbisok tih thayoeituipan la amah kah thincaknah rhuhrhong neh aka duek he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A rhangsuk khaw suktui buem tih a rhuh hliing khaw sulpuem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinglu khahing la duek tih hnothen aka ca pawt he khaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />laipi khuiah rhenten yalh tih a rhit loh a soah a yol.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangmih kah kopoek ka ming phoeiah tangkhuepnah neh kai soah nan hul ni te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hlangcong im te menim? Halang tolhmuen kah dap te menim?” na ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Longpuei aka poeng rhoek te na dawt uh pawt tih amih kah miknoek khaw na hmat uh pawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rhainah khohnin lamloh boethae te a tuem tih thinpom khohnin lamloh a khuen te ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A khoboe te a mikhmuh ah aka phoe pah te unim? A saii bangla a taengah aka thuung te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anih khaw phuel la a khuen vaengah laivuei ni a. hak thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anih ham soklong kah dikmuh khaw tui. Anih hnuk te hlang boeih loh a thoelh tih anih hmai kah hlangmi tae lek pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Te dongah balae tih a honghi la kai he nan hloep uh? Nangmih kah taikhaih khaw boekoeknah la cul coeng,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Temani Eliphaz loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathen te hlang loh s hmaiben a ? Lungming khaw amah la dawk a hmaiben uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tang mai tih na mueluemnah mai akhaw, na khoboe soep cakhaw tlungthang hamla naep aya ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na hinyahnah dongah nang te laitloeknah neh n'khuen tih nang n'tluung a ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na boethae tangkik pawt nim ? Nang kah thaesainah te a bawtnah om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lunglilungla la na manuca na laikoi tih pumtling kah himbai te na pit pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Buhmueh rhathih te tui na tul pawt tih bungpong te buh na hloh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bantha aka khueh hlang loh amah hamla khohmuen a khueh tih a sokah khosa mikhmuh ah a dangrhoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuhmai te kuttling la na tueih tih cadah te a ban na phop pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kaepvai kah pael dongah he khaw na birhihnah neh buengrhuet na let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hmuep khaw na hmu pawt tih tuili tui loh nang n'khuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathen tah vaan sang kah moenih a ? So lah, aisi rhoek kah a lu tah pomsang uh te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te lalah, “Pathen te metlam a mingpha ? Yinnah lamloh lai a tloek a ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anih te khomai loh a huep tih tueng pawh. Te vaengah vaan kah kueluek dongah cet,” na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Boethae hlang rhoek loh a cawt khosuen caehlong nim na ngaithuen salah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tonga uh vaengah a tue pawt ah khaw tuiva loh amih kah khoengim te a hawt pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Pathen te mamih taeng lamloh nong saeh, Tlungthang loh mamih taengah balae a saii eh? ” a ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah loh amih im te hnothen a cung sak sitoe cakhaw halang kah cilsuep tah kai lamloh lakhla saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aka dueng rhoek loh a hmuh vaengah a kohoe uh tih ommongsitoe loh amih te a tamdaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mamih kah thinnaeh a thup vetih amih kah a coih te hmai loh hlawp het pawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah neh hmaiben lamtah te nen te thuung laeh. Nang taengah hnothen ha pawk bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ka lamkah olkhueng mah doe laeh, a ol te khaw na thinko khuiah khueh laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlungthang taengla na mael atah n'thoh bitni dumlai mah na dap lamloh lakhla sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasing te laipi bangla, Ophir te soklong kah lungpang bangla khueh ngawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Te vaengah na pasing te tlungthang la, cak te na ki la poeh bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Te daengah ni Tlungthang dongah na ngailaem vetih Pathen taengla na maelhmai na dangrhoek bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A taengah na thangthui vaengah nang ol a yaak vetih na olcaeng khaw cung ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Olkhueh te na tuiphih vaengah nang hamla thoo vetih na longpuei ah vangnah loh a tue ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kunyun uh vaengah koevoeinah na thui dae tlahoei mik ni a khang eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ommongsitoe pawt khaw loeih vetih na kut kah cimcaihnah loh a loeih sak ni,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tihnin ah khaw boekoek bangla ka kohuetnah loh ka kut he ka hueinah neh a nan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />U loh n'khueh khaw ka ming vetih amah te ka hmuh phoeiah amah kah hmuenmol la ka pha lah mako?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mikhmuh ah laitloeknah ka khueng lah vetih ka ka ah toelthamnah ka paem lah mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Olthui te ka ming tih kai n'doo vaengkah kai hamla a thui te ka yakming lah mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thadueng cungkuem neh kai n'ho saeh a ? Amah loh kai taengah khueh het mahpawt a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aka thuem te a hmaiah a tluung pahoi lah vetih kai he laitloek khui lamloh a yoeyah la ka loeih mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khothoeng la ka caeh mai akhaw amah a om moenih. A hnuk ah khaw anih te ka yakming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banvoei ah a saii vaengah ka hmuh moenih. Bantang la a mael vaengah ka hmuh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tedae longpuei a ming dongah kai he ka taengah n'noemcai tih sui bangla ka thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khokan te ka khopha loh a vai. A longpuei te ka ngaithuen tih ka phael moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmuilai kah olpaek khaw ka hlong pawt tih ka buhvae lakah a ka lamkah ol ni ka khoem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tedae amah tah pakhat la om tih ulong anih a mael thil thai? Te dongah a hinglu kah a ngaih bangla a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka oltlueh te a thuung tih te bang te amah taengah yet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te dongah a mikhmuh lamloh ka let coeng. Ka yakming dongah amah te ka rhih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathen loh kai lungbuei a phoena sak tih tlungthang loh kai n'let sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tedae a hmuep kah maelhmai loh m'biit pawt tih ka maelhmai te a khohmuep loh a dah moenih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Balae tih Tlungthang taeng lamkah a tue te a khoem uh pawh. Amah aka ming, amah aka ming loh a khohnin te hmu uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rhilung a rhawt uh , tuping a rhawth uh tih a luem sakuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cadah kah laak te a vai pah tih nuhmai kah vaito te a laikoi pa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khodaeng rhoek te longpuei lamloh a tulh tih khohmuen kah mangdaeng rhoek khaw rhenten a thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amamih kah bisai la khosoek ah kohong marhang bangla pawk uh coeng ke. Amah ham kolken maeh neh camoe ham buh khaw a toem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lohma ah a kamvuelh te a ah, a ah uh tih halang misurdum kah a yoep uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pumtling rhoek te pueinak tling la a rhaehba sak uh tih khosik vaengah himbai mueh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlang kah cingtui loh a het uh tih hlipyingnah a om mueh la lungpang a kop uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cadah khaw rhangsuk lamloh a suh uh tih mangdaeng rhoek te a laikoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pumtling loh pueinak tling van tih bungpong doela canghmoek a puen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pangbueng ah situi a kuelh tih va-am a cawt uh lalah tui hal uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khopuei lamkah hlang rhoek loh nguekcoi uh tih duekrhok hinglu loh bomnah a bih. Tedae Pathen loh ahohap te a dueh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amih te vangnah aka tloelh lakli ah om uh tih a longpuei hmat uh pawh. Te dongah a hawn ah khosa uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlang aka ngawn loh vangnah hnukah thoo tih mangdaeng neh khodaeng te a rhaem. Khoyin ah hlanghuen bangla om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samphaih mik loh hlaemhmah a lamtawn. Hlang mik loh kai m'mae mahpawh a ti dongah a maelhmai te a huephael la a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hmuep vaengah im a muk. Khothaih ah amih te a tlaeng uh tih vangnah te ming uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dueknah hlipkhup mueirhih neh a hmat uh rhoi dongah dueknah hlipkhup te mincang neh amih taengah rhenten thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anih te tui hman ah hoeptuep. Amih kah hmakhuen te diklai ah a tap dongah misurdum kah longpuei la mop voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rhamrhae neh kholing ah, tui khaw rhaeng tih vuelsong khaw saelkhui ah tholh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bung loh anih a hnilh hil ah a rhit te a poek voel pawt hil a tui sak. Tedae dumlai tah thing bangla tlawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ca aka cun mueh caya aka luem puei neh nuhmai khaw loha pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aka lueng pataeng a thadueng neh a kuel tih thoo mai dae hingnah dongah tangnah om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih te ngaikhuek la pae saeh lamtah hangdang saeh. Tedae Amih longpuei ah a mik a paelki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bet a pomsang uh vaengah amih te pahoi om uh pawt tih tlumhmawn uh. A pum la a buem uh tih cangmo vueilue bangla a baih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Te pawt koinih unim kai aka laithae sak?Ka ol he a hong bangla a khueh mako,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Shuhi Bildad loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A taemrhai ham neh birhihnah he amah hut ni. Amah kah hmuensang ah rhoepnah a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A caem taengah hlangmi om nim?. U soah nim amah kah vangnah a hlah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te dongah hlanghing he Pathen taengah metlam a tang thai? Huta kah a sak te metlam a cim eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mikhmuh ah hla pataeng khaw aa pawt tih aisi khaw a cil moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hlanghing aisat a rhit banghui ni, hlang capa khaw talam banghui,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Metlam thadueng mueh te na bom tih sarhi aka tak mueh bantha te na khang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Metlam lae cueihnah aka tal te na uen tih a cungkuem ah lungming cueihnah na ming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />U taengah nim ol na thui tih nang lamloh u kah hiil nim aka thoeng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sairhai tah tui hmui ah kilkul uh tih kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A taengah saelkhui khaw pumtling om tih Abaddon khaw himbai om pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlangpuei ah hinghong la a yaal tih bang aka om pawt soah khaw diklai a dingkoei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khomai khuiah tui a cun tih cingmai te a hmui ah a ueth pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A cingmai te a soah a yaal tih ngolkhoel hmai a dah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vangnah neh a hmuep laklo kah a khuetnah hamla tui hman ah a rhi a rhuen pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaan kah tung khaw hlinghloek uh tih a tluungnah dongah a ngaihmang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thadueng loh tuipuei te a phih tih a lungcuei neh Rahab a phop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mueihla loh vaan kah khocil a thoeng sak tih a kut loh yingyet rhul khaw a toeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He tah a longpuei dongkah longpuei hmoi ni he. A thayung thamal kah khohum khuiah amah kah ol duem te metlam n'yaak? A thayung thamal te u long a yakming pai eh?” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh amah kah a huel ham te a koei tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pathen kah hingnah loh kai kah laitloeknah a khoe tih Tlungthang lo ka hinglu a phaep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka khuikah ka hiil boeih neh ka hnarhong khuikah he Pathen mueihla ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmuilai loh dumlai thui boel saeh lamtah ka lai loh palyal la caitawk boel saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmih te kan tang sak atah kai ham savisava. Ka pal duela ka muelhtuetnah he kamah lamloh ka khoe mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka duengnah te ka kop vetih ka hlah mahpawh. Kamah tue lamlong tah ka thinko he veet voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thunkha te a halang bangla, kai aka tlai thil khaw a boethae bangla om saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lailak kah ngaiuepnah tah menim? A mueluem tih Pathen loh a hinglu a bong pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A soah citcai loh a pai vaengah a pangngawlnah te Pathen loh a hnatun nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlungthang dongah pang a dok vetih, a tue boeih ah Pathen a khue bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathen kah kut te nangmih kan thuinuet phoe vetih, Tlungthang taengkah te ka phah mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmih boeih khaw na hmuh vaengah balae tih a honghi neh na hoemdawk he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Halang hlang loh Pathen taeng lamkah khoyo neh hlanghaeng loh Tlungthang taeng lamkah rho a dang he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a ca te cunghang hamla a ping pah tih a cadil cahma khaw buh cung uh mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A rhaengnaeng, a rhaengnaeng te dueknah loh a up vetih a nuhmai rhoek loh rhah uh mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cak te laipi bangla hmoeng vetih hnicu te dikpo bangla soe ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tawn cakhaw aka dueng loh a bai vetih cak te ommongsitoe loh a tael ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A im te ning bangla a sak tih dungtlungim bangla rhalrhing a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlanglen la yalh dae khoem uh mahpawh. A mik a dai dae amah om voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih te tui bangla mueirhih loh a phatawt khoyin ah cangpalam loh a pom.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anih te kanghawn loh a khuen tih khum. Te vaengah anih te amah hmuen lamloh a yawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih te a voeih tih lungma a ti pawt dongah a kut lamloh yong la yong coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A taengah a kut a paeng uh tih anih te amah hmuen lamloh kut a ving thil.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cak ham a khorhui om tih sui ham khaw a ciil nah hmuen om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thicung khaw laipi lamloh a loh tih lungto te rhohum la a tlae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A bawtnah te a hmuep neh a khuetnah a cungkuem hil a khueh. Anih loh lungto te a hmuep neh dueknah hlipkhup ah khaw a hoem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Soklong te aka bakuep taeng lamloh a yoe tih kho neh caeh khaw a hnilh uh. Hlanghing lamkah aka tlayae rhoek khaw hinghuen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diklai amah lamloh buh thoeng tih a hmui ah hmai bangla om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungto te minhum hmuen tih a taengah sui laipi om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hawn te vatlung loh ming pawt tih maisi mik loh hmu pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te te sa ca rhoek loh cawt pawt tih te donglong te sathuengca long khaw pawn pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmailung soah a kut a hlah tih tlang pataeng a yung ah a phil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sokko lungpang dongah a khoel tih umponah cungkuem khaw a mik loh a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuiva tuilong khaw a kueng tih olhuep te khosae la a khuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tedae me rhoek ah nim cueihnah a hmuh tih yakmingnah hmuen he menim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A phu te hlanghing loh ming pawt tih mulhing khohmuen ah a hmuh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuidung loh, “Te te kai ah moenih,” a ti tih tuitunli loh, “Kai taengah moenih,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te ham te cui cilh khaw pae thai pawt tih cueihnah a phu te cak khaw a khiing pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir sui nen khaw, oitha lung vang nen khaw minhum nen khawting pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te te sui neh canglung neh tluk pawt tih a hnothung he suicilh hnopai bal moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maerhuhlung neh disaehlung khaw thui lawk pawt tih cueihnah rhovoep tah lungvang lakah then.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te te Kusah vaya nen khaw tluk pawt tih sui cilh nen khaw ting pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te dongah cueihnah he me lamkah nim ha pawk tih yakmingnah hmuen he menim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mulhing boeih kah mik lamloh a thuh pah tih vaan kah vaa taeng lamloh a thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abaddon neh dueknah loh, “A olthang te kaimih hna neh ka yaak uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathen loh a longpuei a yakming tih a hmuen te khaw amah loh a ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah loh diklai khobawt hil a paelki tih vaan hmui khaw boeih a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Yilh kah a khiing a khueh pah tih tui khaw cungnueh neh a nueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah loh khotlan ham rhi a suem tih rhaek ol ham khaw longpuei a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cueihnah te a hmuh tih a tae. Cueihnah te a sikim sak tih a khe bal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hlang taengah khaw, 'Ka Boeipa hinyahnah he cueihnah la om tih boethae lamloh nong he yakmingnah,’ a ti,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job loh amah kah a pom te a cong tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kai he hlamat kah hla bangla aka khueh tih Pathen kah khohnin bangla kai aka tuem te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah loh a hmaithoi te ka lu soah a thangthen tih amah kah vangnah nen ni a. hmuep ah khaw ka caeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka cavaa tue vaengah khaw ka dap ah Pathen kah baecenol la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlungthang te kai taengah om pueng tih, ka kaepvai ka ca rhoek om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khokan te suknaeng neh a hluk tih lungpang loh kai ham situi sokca a long sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vangpuei vongka ah ka thoeng tih toltung ah ka ngolhmuen cikngae sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kai m'hmuh uh vaengah cadong rhoek te thuh uh. Patong rhoek khaw thoo uh tih pai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa rhoek loh olthui te a phah uh tih a kut te a ka dongla a khueh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rhaengsang rhoek ol te a phah tih a lai khaw a dang dongla kap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hna loh a yaak vaengah kai n'uem tih mik loh a hmuh vaengah kai n'rhalrhing sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangdaeng loh bomnah a bih tih cadah neh a taengah aka bom aka om pawt khaw ka loeih sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlang milh kah yoethennah te kai soah pai tih nuhmai kah lungbuei khaw ka tamhoe sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Duengnah te ka bai tih hnikul bangla kai n'khuk. Ka tiktamnah he ka sammuei nah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mikdael taengah mik la, khokhaem taengah kho la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kai tah khodaeng taengah a napa la ka om tih ming pawt kah tuituknah te ka khe pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Boethae kah pumcu te ka thuk pah tih a no lamkah maeh te ka voeih pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te dongah, “Ka bu ah ka pal mako,” ka ti tih laivin bangla khohnin ka puh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka yung loh tui taengla a muk tih buemtui loh ka cangvuei dongah rhaeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thangpomnah ka taengah thai tih ka lii ka kut dongah tinghil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai taengah a hnatun uh tih a lamtawn uh dongah ka cilsuep ham kuemsuem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka ol hnukah talh uh voel pawt tih kai olthui he amih soah tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kai ham tah khotlan bangla a lamtawn uh tih a ka loh tlankhol bangla a ang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amih taengah ka luem dae n'tangnah uh pawt tih ka maelhmai vangnah dongah khaw yalh uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amih kah longpuei te ka coelh tih boeilu la ka ngol. Caem lakli ah manghai bangla kho ka sak tih rhahdoe cangpoem akhaw a hloep.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tedae a kum la kai lakah aka noe long khaw kai taengah luem uh coeng. Te rhoek kah a napa pataeng ka boiva kah ui taengah khueh ham ka hnawt lah mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amih kut dongkah thadueng khaw kai taengah metlam a om? Amih te a hminkhah lamni a paltham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaitahnah neh khokha rhamling lamkah pumhong loh hlaem vaengah khohaeng neh imrhong kah rhamrhae te a cilh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangpuem dongkah baekkoi te a hlaek uh tih a buh la hlingcet yung a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nam lamloh a haek uh tih amih taengah hlanghuen bangla a o uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Soklong cakhom kah laipi neh thaelsawk khui ah kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tangpuem khuiah pang uh tih lota hmuiah poem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aka ang ca rhoek neh ming mueh ca rhoek ni khohmuen lamloh a hawt uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te dongah amih kah rhotoeng la ka om coeng tih amih taengah ol la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai aka tuei rhoek tah kai lamloh lakhla uh tih ka mikhmuh ah timtui khaw tuem uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lirhui lakah ka lirhui he pawl coeng. Te dongah kai he m'phaep tih ka mikhmuh ah kamrhui han tueih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka bantang kah hlangyoe loh tlai ka kho a kalh. Amih kah rhainah caehlong te kai taengah a picai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka talnah khuiah ka hawn a mak uh tih, amih aka bom pawt khaw hoeikhang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A puut aka len bangla ael uh tih a khohli rhamrhael hmuiah paluet uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kai soah mueirhih pai tih khohli bangla ka moeihoeihnah a hloem vaengah kai kah khangnah te khomai bangla a yah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kai lamloh ka hinglu a kingling coeng tih phacip phabaem khohnin loh kai n'tuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khoyin ah ka rhuh te ka pum dong lamloh a cueh. Kai aka thuek he a dim moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thadueng cungkuem dongah ka pueinak a phuelhthaih tih ka angkidung te rhawnmoep bangla ka vah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai he dikpo khuila n'dong tih laipi neh hmaiphu bangla n'thuidoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na taengah bomnah kam bih dae kai nan doo moenih. Ka pai akhaw kai he nan yakming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai soah a muen la na poeh tih na ban thaa neh kai nan konaeh thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kai he khohli dongah nan phueih. Kai nan ngol thil vaengah kai nan paci sak tih lungming cueihnah a yawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mulhing boeih kah tingtunnah im la dueknah neh kai nan mael sak ham khaw ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A yoethaenah khuiah bombihnah a yaak vaengah kut aka thueng he lairhok dongah a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khohnin a mangkhak dongah ka rhap tih khodaeng dongah ka hinglu a omdam moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A then ka lamtawn vaengah boethae ha pawk. Vangnah te ka ngaiuep vaengah a hmuep ha pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka bung he tlawk tih a kuemsuem moenih. Kai he phacip phabaem khohnin loh n'doe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khomik a tal dongah maelhmai a hmuep la ka cet. Hlangping neh ka pai tih ka pang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pongui kah a manuca neh tuirhuk vanu kah a hui la ka om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vin khaw kamah dong lamloh mu tih ka rhuh khaw kholing neh tlum coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka rhotoeng te nguekcoinah la, ka phavi rhah ol la poeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paipi te ka mik neh ka saii dongah me tlam lae oila te ka yakming eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A so lamkah Pathen khoyo neh hmuensang lamkah Tlungthang rho te menim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Boethae ham rhainah neh boethae aka saii ham yoethaenah moenih a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah loh ka longpuei a hmuh tih ka khokan boeih he a tae moenih a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A poeyoek taengah ka pongpa tih ka kho loh a hlangthai palat taengla a tawn uh atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Duengnah cooi dongah kai n'khiing saeh lamtah Pathen loh ka muelhtuetnah ming saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Longpuei lamloh ka khokan a buung atah, ka mik hnukah ka lungbuei cet tih ka kut dongah a lolhmaih a kap atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka soem vaengah a tloe loh ca saeh lamtah ka cadil rhoek te ha uh saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huta loh ka lungbuei a hlae tih ka hui kah thohka ah ka rhongngol atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka yuu loh a tloe la kuelh saeh lamtah a taengah hlang tloe bakop mai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te dongah te khonuen rhamtat neh te te thaesainah rhokhan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te hmai loh Abaddon duela a hlawp tih ka cangvuei te boeih ha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka salpa neh ka salnu loh kai taengah a tuituk vaengah tiktamnah ka hnawt atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathen a thoh vaengah balae ka saii vetih n'hip vaengah amah te metlam ol ka mael eh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bungko khuiah kai aka saii loh anih a saii moenih a? Kaimih he bung khuiah pakhat la n'cuen sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tattloel kah kongaih te ka hloh pah tih nuhmai mik te ka khah sak koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamah buhkam te kamah bueng loh ka caak tih cadah loh ca pawt koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka camoe lamloh napa bangla ka taengah pantai tih nuhmai khaw a nu bung lamloh ka mawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pueinak mueh tih himbai tling la aka milh khodaeng te ka hmuh mai tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pumpu, a pumpu ah kai n'uem uh vaengah ka tu mul neh ka hlung pawt mai koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vongka ah kai bomkung te ka hmuh vaengah ka kut he cadah soah ka ka thueng atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka laengpang he a hnuk lamloh rhul saeh lamtah ka ban a cung dong lamloh tlawt mai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathen taengkah rhainah te kai ham ka birhihnah la a om dongah a boeimangnah te ka noeng moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sui te ka uepnah la ka khueh tih sui cilh te ka pangtungnah la ka thui koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka thadueng len tih ka kut loh a khuet la a hmuh dongah ka kokhahnah atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vangnah dongah a thangthen tih hla vang a thoeih te ka hmuh vaengah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ka lungbuei he yinhnuk ah hloih tih ka kut loh ka ka te mok koinih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />He khaw a so kah Pathen taengah ka basa la om vetih thaesainah lai la om ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka lunguet kah yoethaenah dongah ka kohoe tih yoethae loh anih taengla a thoeng te ka haenghang puei atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A hinglu te thaephoeinah neh hoe hamla ka ka he laihmu la ka khueh aih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka dap kah hlang rhoek loh, “U long nim a maeh te a cung pawt la a paek eh?” a ti uh moenih a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka thohkhaih kah yinlai te caehlong ka ong pah tih vongvoel ah a rhaeh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hlang bangla ka boekoeknah ka dah tih, kai kathaesainah he ka thindang ah ka det mai akhaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />hlangping te yet taengah ka sarhing tih huiko kah nueihbu loh kai n'rhihyawp sak. Te dongah ka kuemsuem tih thohka la ka moe pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kai taengkah aka hnatun la kamah taengah u long nim m'paek lah mako? Ka kutha he Tlungthang loh kai n'doo saeh lamtah ka tuituknah he hlang loh cabu la daek saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Te te ka laengpang ah ka koh vetih te te ka soah rhuisam la ka laikoeinah het mahpawt nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka khokan tarhing la a taengah ka puen lah vetih anih te rhaengsang bangla ka paan lah mako.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka khohmuen loh kai m'pang thil tih a kong te rhenten rhap koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A thadueng te tangka mueh la ka caak tih a kungmah kah hinglu ka yawn sak atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cang yueng la mutlo hling, cangtun yueng la saeldol khaw poe saeh,” a ti. Job kah ol bawt coeng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amah mikhmuh ah amah te a dueng sak dongah te rhoek hlang pathum Job a doo te kangkuen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te dongah Ram koca kah Buzi Barakel capa Elihu kah a thintoek tah Job taengah sai coeng. Pathen lakah amah hinglu te a tang sak dongah a thintoek khaw sai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hlatnah hmu uh pawt dae Job te a boe sak uh dongah anih kah thintoek khaw a hui pathum taengah sai van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amih boeih khuiah Elihu tah a kum la a ham dongah Job te ol neh a rhing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlang pathum ka dongah hlatnah a om pawt te Elihu a hmuh vaengah a thintoek te sai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah Buzi Barakel capa Elihu loh a doo tih, “Kai he a kum la ka noe tih nangmih tah na ham. Te dongah ka kawl uh tih nangmih taengah kamah kah poeknah thui ham khaw ka rhih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cueihnah he a khohnin nen khaw a thui uh vetih kum a yet a tukkil uh mako ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mueihla he hlanghing ah om dae Tlungthang hiil long ni amih a yakming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muep aka cueih neh patong rhoek loh khaw laitloeknah te a yakming uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah kai taengkah hnatun uh lah ka ti. Kai khaw ka poeknah ka thui van eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmih ol te ka lamtawn ne. Olthui na khe uh vaengah nangmih kah lungcuei te hna ka kaeng thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmih khaw kan yakming vaengah Job taengkah a tluung ol te aka doo na om uh moenih he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Cueihnah m'hmuh coeng, anih te hlang pawt tih Pathen loh khoek saeh,” ti uh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Olthui neh kai taengah rhong a pai pawt dongah nangmih ol neh anih te ka thuung mahpawh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amih lamkah ol khaw vawt uh tih, a rhihyawp uh dongah koep doo uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Koep doo mueh la pai uh tih a cal uh pawt dongah ka lamtawn aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai khaw kamah hamsum te ka doo vetih kai khaw kamah kah poeknah te ka thui van ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Olthui khaw ka hah tih ka bungko kah mueihla loh kamah n'kilh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka bungko he misurtui bangla khui pawt tih tui-um thai bangla ueth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thui daengah ni kai ham a hoengpoek eh. Ka hmuilai ka ong vetih ka doo pueng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlang maelhmai te ka dan tarha pawt vetih hlang te ka hlae tarha mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlang hlae ham khaw ka ming moenih, kai aka saii loh kai he phawn n'khoe lah ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job, ka olthui hnatun dae lamtah ka ol boeih he hnakaeng thil laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ka ong coeng he. Ka ka khuikah ka lai loh a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ol he ka lungbuei dueng lamkah tih ka hmuilai kah mingnah loh cimphan la a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathen Mueihla loh kai n'saii tih Tlungthang kah hiil loh kai n'hing sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kai thuung hamla na coeng mak atah tawn uh lamtah ka mikhmuh ah pai laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathen taengah kai he nang ka bangla ka om tih kai khaw dikpo lamkah ni m'pet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kai he mueirhih moenih nang n'let sak mako. Ka kut long khaw nang n'nan thil mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tedae ka hna ah na thui tih olthui ol khaw ka yaak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka cil tih boekoek ka khueh moenih. Ka caih tih kai taengah thaesainah om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te cakhaw kai taengkah noihhainah a hmuh vaengah kai amah kah thunkha bangla a moeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kho he hloong dongah a buen tih ka caehlong boeih a dawn,” na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tedae na tang moenih he. Pathen he hlanghing lakah a len dongah nang te kan doo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Balae tih amah te na ho. A ol te boeih n'doo moenih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathen loh pakhat la a thui dae a hmuhming pawt atah hnavoei la a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih loh hlang a hnah vaengkah khoyin olphong mueimang ah khaw, thingkong dongkah a ngam vaengah khaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hlang hna te a khui sak tih amih kah rhalrhingnah neh a daeng pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlang loh a khoboe lamkah a nong sak tih hlang lamkah koevoeinah a khuk pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hinglu te vaam khui lamloh, a hingnah te pumcumnah loh a paan khui lamkah a hoeptlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thingkong dongah nganboh neh a tluung tih tuituknah loh a rhuhrhong boeih te phat a thuek pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hingnah loh buh te khaw a hinglu loh hoehhamnah maeh khaw a lawt pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A saa te caphoei cuk bangla mueihmuh ah a khah tih a rhuh a hmuh pawt khaw a ming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hinglu loh vaam khuila, a hingnah te aka duek rhoek taengla pawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih kah duengnah te hlang taengah aka puen la thawngkhat lamkah pakhat ngawn tah amah taengah puencawn oldoe om khaming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te dongah anih te a rhen mai vetih, 'Tlansum ka dang tih hlan kah aka suntla khui lamloh anih he doek laeh,’ ti mai koinih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A saa te camoe bangla noe vetih a cacawn tue vaengkah bangla saibawn suidae.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathen taengah a thangthui vanbangla anih te a moeithen ta. A maelhmai te tamlung neh a hmuh vaengah tah anih te hlanghing taengah duengnah neh a mael sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hlang rhoek taengla a mae tih, “Ka tholh tih a thuem te a paihaeh sak dae kai taengah n'yook sak moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kamah hinglu, hinglu van tah hlan a paan khui lamloh a lat. Te dongah ka hingnah neh a hingnah loh vangnah te hmu saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He boeih he Pathen loh hlang taengah voei nit voei thum a saii ne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hlan khui lamkah a hinglu te hingnah khosae neh tue hamla a mael sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Job nang hnatung lamtah kai ol he hnatun. Hilphah lamtah kai loh kan thui eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kai nan thuung ham ol a om atah thui lah. Nang tang sak ham ka ngaih dongah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kai taengkah he na hnatun pawt atah hilphah lamtah nang te cueihnah kan cang sak bitni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu loh koep a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aka cueih rhoek ka ol hnatun uh lamtah aka ming rhoek loh kai taengla hnakaeng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hna loh olthui a nuemnai tih lai loh caak te a ten.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tiktamnah te mamih ham coelh uh sih lamtah a then te mamih lakli ah ming uh sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Job loh,'Ka tang lalah Pathen loh ka tiktamnah a hnawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tiktamnah khaw ka laithae bang mai la boekoeknah pawt mai ah ka thaltang loh rhawp coeng,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui bangla tamdaengnah aka o Job bang hlang he om nim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Boethae aka saii neh rhoihui bangla yiin tih halang hlang rhoek taengah khaw pongpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />'Pathen taengah a ngaingaih vaengah hlang hmaiben pawh,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah thinko aka khueh hlang rhoek loh kai taengah hnatun uh. Halangnah he Pathen lamloh savisava tih Tlungthang he dumlai neh savisava coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hlang kah bisai he amah taengla a thuung tih hlang a caehlong bangla amah loh a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathen tah boe tueng pawt tih Tlungthang loh tiktamnah te a khun sak moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah loh diklai ah unim a khueh tih lunglai he a pum la u taengah nim a tloeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah taengkah loh a khueh a lungbuei, a mueihla neh a hiil te amah taengla khoem koinih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pumsa boeih he rhenten pal vetih hlang he laipi la mael ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yakmingnah a om atah he he hnatun lamtah ka olthui ol he hnakaeng lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tiktamnah aka thiinah aisat loh a ngoldoelh tih aka dueng khuet loh m'boe sak aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manghai te,'hlang muen,’ hlangcong te 'Halang,’ a ti nah nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah loh mangpa maelhmai dan pawt tih tattloel maelhmai lakah rhoeikhang kah a hmat tloe moenih. Amih boeih te amah kut dongah kutngo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mikhaptok ah a duek dongah pilnam khoyin pathung ah tuen tih khum uh. Kut nen pawt akhaw aka lueng a khoe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mik te hlang kah longpuei dongah a khueh tih a khokan boeih te a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Boethae aka saii rhoek thuh hamla hmaisuep om pawt tih dueknah hlipkhup khaw a om moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathen taengkah laitloeknah dongla a pha ham coeng dongah hlang te koep a cae moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aka khuet khenah a om pawt ah a phaek tih amih yueng la a tloe a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amih kah khoboe te a hmat dongah khoyin ah a maelh tih pop uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Halang rhoek ham tah hmuh nah hmuen ah amih te kut a paeng thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Te dongah ni a hnuk lamloh nong uh tangloeng tih a longpuei boeih te cangbam uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tattloel kah pangngawlnah te a taengla pawk tih mangdaeng kah pangngawlnah a yaak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tedae amah te mong tih ulong a boe sak. Maelhmai a thuh vaengah ulong anih a mae? Tedae namtom so neh hlang khat soah khaw rhenten om ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lailak hlang a manghai khaw pilnam ham hlaeh la poeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathen taengah tah,'Ka laikoi pawt khaw ka phueih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang kam hmuh pawt ah kai nan thuinuet coeng. Dumlai ka saii mai cakhaw ka koei voel boel eh?,’ a ti nama thui coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na hnawt coeng dongah te kah te namah taeng lamloh na thuung aya? Namah loh na coelh coeng, kai long moenih. Te dongah na ming te thui to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thinko aka khueh hlang rhoek loh kai taengah thui uh lamtah hlang cueih loh kai taengkah he hnatun saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Job he mingnah neh cal pawt tih a ol long a cangbam moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A pa nae, boethae hlang kah taikhaih dongah Job loh a yoeyah la loepdak saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A tholhnah te mamih laklo ah boekoek neh a koei uh tih kut a paeng dongah Pathen taengah a ol pung,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu loh koep a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“'Patheni lakah kamah duengnah ngai,’ na ti te tiktamnah la na poek a te?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />'Ka tholhnah lamloh nang hamla balae a hmaiben tih balae a hoeikhang,’ na ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Namah neh na taengkah na hui rhoek kah olthui te ka thuung eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaan ke paelki lamtah hmu van lah. Nang lakah aka sang khomong ke dan lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tholh koinih amah te metlam a ben eh? Na boekoeknah pungtai koinih amah taengah balae a saii eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tang atah amah taengah balae na paek? Na kut lamloh balae a loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang bang, na halangnah khaw hlang ham tih na duengnah khaw hlang capa ham ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnaemtaeknah cungkuem hmuiah aka tlung bantha lamloh bombih hamla pang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tedae, “Kai aka saii tih khoyin ah laa aka pae Pathen te ta?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Diklai rhamsa lakah mamih n'cang puei tih vaan kah vaa lakah mamih n'cueih sak,’ a ti moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pang uh pahoi cakhaw boethae rhoek kah hoemdamnah hmai ah tah a doo moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Patheni loh a poeyoek la hnatun pawt tih Tlungthang long khaw a hmuhming moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmuhming pawt tih na thui vaeng aisat, dumlai pataeng amah mikhmuh ah a pha dongah amah mah rhingda laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tedae a thintoek te cawh voel pawt oeh coeng tih halangnah te khaw ming voel pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Job loh a honghi la a ka a ang tih mingnah om pawt ah a olthui yet,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu loh koep a cong tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kamah taengah bet m'bulbo uh lamtah nangmih te olthui khaw Pathen yueng la koep kan thui eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka poeknah he khohla lamloh kam phueih tih duengnah he kai aka saii ham ni ka khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka olthui he a honghi pawt dongah nang taengkah lungming khaw a cuemthuek ham tueng pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathen tah khuet tih lungbuei thadueng a khuet te a sit moenih ne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Halang te hlun pawt tih mangdaeng te tiktamnah la a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mik te hlangdueng taeng lamloh khap pawt tih manghai rhoek te ngolkhoel dongah a ngol sak. Te phoeiah amih a yoeyah la a thuung tih a sang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tedae hmaipom neh pin uh tih phacip phabaem rhuihet neh a tuuk uh atah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amih kah bisai neh a boekoeknah dongah a len uh te khaw amih taengah a thui pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuituennah hamla amih hna te a vueh pah tih boethae lamloh mael hamla a thui pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hnatun uh tih tho a thueng koinih a khohnin then neh thok tih a kum te a naepnoi la boeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tedae a hnatun uh pawt atah pumcumnah neh a paan uh vetih mingnah aka tal bangla pal uh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungbuei lailak rhoek loh thintoek a khueh uh tih amih a khih vaengah pataeng bomnah bih pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amih hinglu te camoe la, a hingnah khaw hlanghalh lakli ah duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A phacip phabaem vaengah mangdaeng khaw a pumcum sak tih a hna te nennah neh a toeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rhal ka lamloh hmuenka la nang m'poh. Te lam te mangdaeng mangtok om pawt tih na caboei dongkah mongnah maehhloi ngang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Halang kah dumlai khaw na cung sak tih dumlai neh laitloeknah loh m'moep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kosi loh nang te boeinah neh m'vuet ve ne. Te dongah tlansum cungkuem loh nang m'phaelh boel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rhal khuiah pawt khaw, na bombihnah neh thadueng, thayung boeih loh m'khoembael aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hmuikah pilnam a khum sak ham khoyin khaw hloem aih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngaithuen, boethae taengla mael boeh. Te te phacip phabaem lakah te na tuek coeng te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathen tah amah thadueng neh thaphoh uh coeng ke. Amah bangla unim aka saya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anih ham a longpuei te u long nim a tae pah tih u long nim, 'Dumlai na saii,’ a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah kah bisai na rhoeng sak ham te poek. Te ni hlang rhoek loh a hlai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hlang boeih loh te te a hmuh uh tih hlanghing loh khohla lamkah a paelki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathen tah a len dongah a kum tarhing te m'ming uh lek pawt tih khenah lek pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tui dongkah aangpi a yoek tih khotlan te a tuihu lamloh a ciil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khomong khaw cip tih hlang soah muep pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khomai maiyan neh a dungtlungim kah pang ol a yakming mai ngawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A vangnah loh a taengah a kah tih tuitunli yung duela a khuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Te nen te pilnam taengah lai a tloek tih a yet taengah caak a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kut dongkah vangnah loh a khuk tih phek a cuuk ham khaw te te a uen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A khohum loh amah kawng te a doek tih boiva pataeng thintoek neh cet.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />He dongah ka lungbuei lakueng tih a hmuen lamloh cungpet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ol dongkah khoponah te hnatun hnatun. A ka lamloh caitawknah thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaan boeih hmuiah a hlah tih a vangnah loh diklai hmoi duela pawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnukkah a kawk ol khaw a hoemdamnah ol neh hum tih a ol a yaak vaengah rhaek uelh sak boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathen loh a ol neh khobaerhambae a saii khungdaeng tih hum dae m'ming uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vuelsong neh khotlan khonal te, 'Diklai ah om saeh,’ a ti vaengah khotlan khonal khaw a sarhi tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah kutngo hlang boeih ming sak ham hlang boeih kah kut te rhodaek a soei pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te vaengah mulhing khaw a khui la kun tih a khuisaek ah kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cangpalam te imkhui lamloh, khosik te tlangpuei lamloh ha thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathen kah hiil lamloh rhaelnu khaw a khueh tih tui daang mangdaeng mangtok la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khomai te cingtui loh a rhih sak tih cingmai loh amah kah vangnah te a taekyak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te khaw diklai kah lunglai hman ah a uen boeih te saii hamla a niing, a niing dongah kuluk la a hil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te te caitueng lam khaw, a khohmuen ham khaw, sitlohnah ham khaw a thoeng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job, he he hnakaeng lah. Pai lamtah Pathen kah khobaerhambae he yakming lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te rhoek soah Pathen loh a khueh tih a cingmai kah vangnah a sae te na ming a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Poeknah rhuemtuet, mangvawt khomai a haainah te na ming a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuithim loh khohmuen a mong sak vaengah na himbai te aka bae sak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmaidan a hlawn bangla khomong a thah la amah taengah na nulh thai aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah taengah metla n'thui ham khaw kaimih tueng lah. Hmaisuep hmai ah n'tawn uh thai pawt oe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hlang loh a dolh hamla thui cakhaw ka thui bangla amah taengah a tae pa aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tahae ah khaw vangnah a hmuh uh moenih. A aa te khohli loh a yawn tih a caihcil hnukkah khomong dongah tueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tlangpuei lamkah sui te mueithennah rhih om Pathen taengla pawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tlungthang te thadueng a len dongah a tiktamnah m'hmuh lek moenih. Duengnah khaw a cungkuem dongah hlang a phaep moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hlang rhoek loh amah te a rhih uh tangloeng dongah lungbuei aka cueih rhoek takuem khaw a sawt moenih,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Job te hlipuei khui lamloh a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mingnah aka tal olthui neh cilsuep aka hmuep sak te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hlang bangla na pumpu yen lamtah nang kan dawt bangla kai he n'tueng laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Diklai ka suen vaengah melam na om? Yakmingnah na ming atah thui lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />U loh a khodang a khueh khaw na ming van nim? A soah rhilam aka yueng khaw unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A buenhol te me dongah nim a buen tih, a bangkil lung te unim aka thuinuet?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mincang aisi rhoek rhenten tamhoe uh tih Pathen ca rhoek boeih yuhui uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuitunli te a bung lamloh a poh tih a coe vaengah thohkhaih neh a tlaeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai loh cingmai kah a pueinak neh anih kah yinnah hni khaw ka khueh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka oltlueh he anih ham ka tlueh pah tih thohkalh neh thohkhaih khaw ka khueh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He hil ka ti vaengah ha mop lamtah koei boeh. Na hoemdamnah tuiphu te he ah he khueh laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namah tue vaengah mincang ke na uen a? Khothaih ke na ming tih amah hmuen ah khothaih a om khaw na ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te lamkah halang rhoek khoek ham neh diklai hmoi a tuuk sak ham khaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dikpo kutbuen bangla poehlip tih pueinak bangla pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Halang rhoek te amamih kah vangnah a hloh pah tih ban a thueng khaw a tlawt sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuitunli kah tuiput la na pawk tih tuidung kah khenah dongah na pongpa vai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang taengah dueknah vongka rhoek ah uh tih dueknah hlipkhup vongka te na hmuh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Diklai hmuenka duela na yakming nim? A cungkuem la na ming atah thui lah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vangnah aka om longpuei he menim? Hmaisuep kah a hmuen he melae?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te te amah khorhi la na thak van tih a im kah a hawn khaw na yakming van nim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang n'sak tih na khohnin kah a tarhing a puh daengah ni na ming pueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vuelsong thakvoh khuila na kun tih rhaelnu thakvoh na hmuh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te te rhal tue vaengkah ham khaw, caemrhal neh caemtloek tue vaengkah ham khaw ka tuem pueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Diklai ah kanghawn loh a taekyak tih, vangnah loh a tael longpuei te menim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuilong lungpook ham neh rhaek ol ham longpuei aka tael te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khuiah tongpa aka om pawh khosoek neh hlang aka tal khohmuen ah khaw rhotui aka tlan sak la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />khohli rhamrhael neh imrhong aka hah sak la, toitlim annoe aka poe sak la om coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khotlan te a napa om a? Buemtui tuicip te ulong a sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rhaelnu he u kah bungko lamkah nim a thoeng tih, vaan vueltling te ulong a sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tui khaw lungto bangla thuh uh tih tuidung hman ah khal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Airhitbom kah omngaih omloe te na hlaengtang tih buhol phueihrhui khaw na hlawt thai aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mazzaroth aisi te amah tue vaengah na thoeng sak tih Ayish aisi te a ca rhoek neh na mawt a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaan kah khosing te na ming atah amah kah laithuithainah te diklai ah na khueh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na ol te khomai dongla na huel thai tih tuili tui te na khuk thai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rhaek na tueih vaengah cet uh tih nang taengah, “Kaimih la he,” a ti uh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kodang khuila cueihnah aka khueh te unim? Kopoek khuiah yakmingnah aka pae te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cueihnah neh khomong aka tae te unim? Vaan tuitang aka thael te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Me vaengah lae Laipi a hlawn la a hlom tih dikmuh a man sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />sathuengnu hamla maeh na mae pah tih sathuengca kah hingnah na tom pah a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Me vaengah lae a khuisaek ah a ngam uh tih thingpuep khui ah a kol uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A sakah te vangak ham aka tawn pah te unim? A camoe, a camoe uh vaengah tah Pathen taengah bomnah a bih uh dae caak mueh la kho a hmang uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thaelpang kah sathai a piil tue na ming tih sayuk a rhai na dawn a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hla a cup la na tae tih a piil tue na ming a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ca rhoek loh a koisu uh tih a huel daengah a bungtloh loh a hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ca a man uh te cangpai neh rhoeng tih a caeh uh phoeiah tah amih taengla mael uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sayalh la kohong marhang aka hlah te unim? Laak lueng kah kuelrhui aka hlam te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A im te kolken la, a dungtlungim te lungkaehlai la ka khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khorha kah hlangping te a lawn tih aka tueihno kah pang ol hnatun pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A luemnah tlang te a cawt tih sulhing boeih te a yoep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cung loh nang taengah a thohtat hamla a huem vetih na kongduk dongah rhaeh aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cung te a rhuivaeh kong ah na pael vetih nang hnukah tuikol te a thoe aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thadueng a len dongah a soah na pangtung vetih na thaphu te a taengah na hnoo aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na cangti te a khuen, a khuen vetih na cangtilhmuen a coi ni tila te te na tangnah a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kalaukva kah phae loh yoka cakhaw bungrho phaemul neh a dii aih nim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A duei te diklai dongah a hnoo tih laipi khuiah a awp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kho loh a hep te a hnilh tih kohong mulhing long khaw te te a til.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ca rhoek te amah kah pawt bangla a hit sak tih a poeyoek la a thaphu te birhihnah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathen loh anih te cueihnah a hnilh sak tih a taengah yakmingnah tael pah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmuensang la a phuel uh tue vaegah tah marhang neh a sokah aka ngol te a nueih thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Marhang taengah thayung thamal na paek a? A rhawn te a hnoo neh na thing pah a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih te kaisih bangla na pet sak a? A phit vaengkah mueithennah khaw mueirhih la poeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuikol te a phuet uh vaengah thadueng neh a ngaingaih lungpok haica doe hamla pawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rhihnah te a nueih thil tih a rhihyawp pawt dongah cunghang ha lamloh a mael moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A taengah liva a khoek tih caai neh soe kaw hmaihluei la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinghuen neh khoponah neh diklai a coih tih tuki ol te tangnah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuki te a rhoeh la, “Ahuei,” a ti nah tih caemtloek vaengkah mangpa khohum neh tamlung te a hla lamloh a huep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang kah yakmingnah dongah nim mutlo loh a phae a phuel tih a ding, a phae te tuithim la a phuel?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang kah ka dongah atha te sang hang tih a bu a pomsang a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thaelpang ah kho a sak tih thaelpang hmuisum neh rhalvong ah khaw rhaeh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Te lamloh caak a thaih tih a hla lamkah te a mik loh a paelki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Te vaengah a vapuel, a vapuel loh thii a caep uh tih rhok om nah ah hnap om,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah BOEIPA loh Job te a voek tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlungthang te a ho a? Cawtkung aka tluung te Pathen loh doo nawn saeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te vaengah Job loh BOEIPA te a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kai n'kosinah coeng he. Namah te metlam kan thuung eh? Ka kut he ka ka dongla ka puei mai coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vai ka thui vaengah ka doo voel pawt dongah pabae nen khaw ka koei mahpawh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te phoeiah BOEIPA loh Job te hlipuei khui lamloh a voek tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlang bangla na pumpu te yen laeh. Nang kan dawt vaengah kai m'ming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka laitloeknah he na phae tang aya? Na tang hamla kai nan boe sak aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang te Pathen bangla na ban om tih ol neh rhaek bangla na hum a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoemdamnah neh na oeknah te oi laeh lamtah mueithennah neh rhuepomnah te bai laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thinpom thintoek te sah laeh. Thinthah boeih te so lamtah anih te kunyun sak laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thinthah boeih te so lah. Anih te kunyun sak lamtah halang rhoek khaw a hmui la daep laeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amih te laipi khuila det lamtah a thuh khuiah khaw a maelhmai te rhenten poi pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te vaengah na bantang kut loh nang te n'khang thai tila kai loh nang kang uem van ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Behemoth te namah neh kan saii tih saelhung bangla sulrham ka cah coeng ke.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thadueng te a cinghen ah, a thahuem te a bungko kah thanal dongah om coeng ke.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mai te lamphai thing bangla a hloih tih a phaiboeng, a phaiboeng te a tharhui loh a cut pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A rhuh te rhohum tuicawn bangla, a songrhuh khaw thi boeng bangla om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anih tah Pathen kah longpuei a tongnah om tih, anih aka saii long ni a cunghang a tawn thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlang kah cakkoi te anih taengla a phueih uh tih kohong mulhing boeih te pahoi luem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Yinhnuk ah hlip hmuila capu neh nongtui dongah yalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anih te hlip kah a hlipkhup loh a dah tih anih te soklong tuirhi loh a vael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuiva loh a kawt akhaw a tamto moenih. Jordan loh a ka a hoh pa akhaw a omtoem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anih te a mik neh a loh tih hlaeh neh a hnarhong a toeh a?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leviathan te vaih neh na doek tih rhui neh a lai na yueh pah thai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnarhong ah canghlong na hen thai tih mutlo hling neh a kam na toeh a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang ham tah huithuinah loh puh vetih nang taengah a mongkawt la cal mai aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang taengah paipi a saii vetih anih te kumhal kah sal la na loh aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih te vaa bangla na luem puei vetih anih te na hula hamla na khih pa aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih ham te thimpom rhoek tael uh thae vetih Kanaan laklo ah a paekboe uh aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vin dongah palaphae neh, a lu dongah nga khohcung neh na bae sak thai a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anih soah na kut tloeng lamtah poek laeh. Caemtloeknah khaw na koei voel mahpawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ngaiuepnah khaw a laithae ni te. A mueimae mah a hut tang aya?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih a haeng ham khaw a muen aih bal moenih. Te dongah ka mikhmuh ah aka pai thai te unim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai n'doe bangla unim ka thuung eh? Vaan hmui kah boeih te kamah kah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah ham bueng pawt tih a olsai neh thayung thamal ol khaw, a phu dongkah a sakthen khaw ka phah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pueinak te a hmai la ulong poelyoe pah. Kamrhui rhaepnit neh anih te ulong a paan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A maelhmai kah thohkhaih te ulong a ong eh? A no khaw mueirhih la pin om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lip photling a hoemnah khaw kutbuen neh a caek la a khaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khat te khat taengla tawn uh tih a laklo ah yilh khaw hue pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hlang he a manuca taengah balak tih a tuuk uh daengah ni a. pam uh pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ikthi loh vangnah a thangthen tih a mik khaw mincang khosaeng banghui ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ka lamkah hmaithoi thoeng tih hmai hli coe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnarhong lamkah hmaikhu khaw voh neh canghlong a yawn bangla thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hinglu loh hmai-alh a tak sak tih a ka lamloh hmaihluei thoeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A rhawn ah a sarhi naeh tih a mikhmuh ah rhihnah loh malawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A saa laep te a pum dongah malh kap tih khok pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungbuei te lungto bangla ning tih a dangkah phaklung bangla ning.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A boeimang vaengah tah tholh pocinah khui lamloh Pathen taengah bakuep uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anih aka kae cunghang neh caai khaw, lungsong neh caempho khaw a thoh moenih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te phoeiah Job loh BOEIPA te a doo tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A cungkuem he na noeng tih namah kah thuepnah oel thai pawh tila ka ming rhoe, ka ming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mingnah om mueh ah cilsuep aka dael he unim? Ka thui tangloeng ngawn dae ka yakming moenih. Kai lamlong tah khobaerhambae coeng tih ka ming voel moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnatun dae lamtah ka thui dae eh. Nang kan dawt vaengah mah kai m'ming sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hna dongah olthang la nang kan yaak dae ka mik loh nang m'hmuh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah ka kohnue coeng tih laipi neh hmaiphu khuiah damti coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Job taengah hekah ol he a thui hnukah tah BOEIPA loh Temani Eliphaz te, “Ka thintoek he nang taeng neh na hui rhoi taengah sai coeng. Ka sal Job bangla kai kawng he a sikim la na thui uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te dongah namamih ham vaito pumrhih neh tuital pumrhih te lo uh lamtah ka sal Job taengla cet uh laeh. Te vaengah namamih hamla hmueihhlutnah nawn uh lamtah ka sal Job te nangmih ham thangthui saeh. Anih maelhmai tah ka doe vetih nangmih taengah boethaehalang ka saii mahpawh. Ka sal Job bangla kai kawng he a sikim la na thui uh moenih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te phoeiah Temani Eliphaz, Shuhi Bildad, Naamathi Zophar tah cet uh tih BOEIPA loh amih taengah a thui te a saii uh. Te daengah ni BOEIPA loh Job kah maelhmai te a doe pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hui rhoek ham a thangthui phoeiah tah Job kah a koe, a koe te BOEIPA loh a mael pah. Te boeih te BOEIPA loh Job taengah rhaepnit la a koei pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te vaengah a manuca boeih neh a tanu, a tanu boeih khaw, lamhma ah anih aka ming boeih khaw anih taengla cet uh. A im khuiah amah neh buh a caak uh. Anih te a suem uh tih a soah BOEIPA loh a thoeng sak yoethae cungkuem ham khaw anih te a hloep uh. Te vaengah anih te tangka phikat rhip neh sui hnaii pakhat rhip a paek uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BOEIPA loh Job te a tongnah kah lakah a hmailong te yoethen a paek. Te dongah a taengah boiva thawng hlai li, kalauk thawng rhuk, vaito a rhoi thawngkhat, laak thawng khat a khueh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A taengah capa parhih neh canu pathum a khueh bal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A cuek ming te Jemimah, a pabae ming te Keziah, a pathum ming te Kerenhappukh a sui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Job canu rhoek bangla diklai pum ah huta sakthen a phoe moenih. Amih te khaw a napa loh a nganpa rhoek lakli ah rho a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te phoeiah Job te kum ya sawmli hing. A ca rhoek te khaw, a ca kah a ca khaw a khong li duela a hmuh tih a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te dongah Job tah patong tih a khohnin a cup la duek.
  </para>
</usx>
